    \   |   0.028646  \n  47    |   0.028130   |   0.028760  \n  48    |   0.028109   |   0.028686  \n  49    |   0.028115   |   0.028750  \n  50    |   0.028104   |   0.028940  \n  51    |   0.028092   |   0.028723  \n  52    |   0.028079   |   0.028643  \n  53    |   0.028083   |   0.028646  \n  54    |   0.028092   |   0.029495  \n  55    |   0.028068   |   0.028704  \n  56    |   0.028073   |   0.028660  \n  57    |   0.028067   |   0.028688  \n  58    |   0.028067   |   0.028589  \n  59    |   0.028049   |   0.028731  \n  60    |   0.028052   |   0.028744  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2722.7s at epoch 60\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2722.7s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028589\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.028589\nTraining time: 2729s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 406f3c76-33d7-4307-afcd-09971b6d32a7\nTotal time: 2745s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22\
