role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 34\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 137,493 / 600,000 used (23%)\n- Agent Age: 34 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'MoE: CNN Temporal Encoder, Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts' (ID: 53) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent\
    \ call last):\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/f14c03dd-a86f-4efa-b72b-f723390f26cb/tmp/1e5d4784-645a-40ef-adbd-1eee7b5e62d6/storage/system/main.py\", line 534, in <module>\n    result = main()\n             ^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/f14c03dd-a86f-4efa-b72b-f723390f26cb/tmp/1e5d4784-645a-40ef-adbd-1eee7b5e62d6/storage/system/main.py\", line 510, in main\n    validation_success = simple_cpu_validation()\n                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/f14c03dd-a86f-4efa-b72b-f723390f26cb/tmp/1e5d4784-645a-40ef-adbd-1eee7b5e62d6/storage/system/main.py\", line 329, in simple_cpu_validation\n    params = network.init(key, dummy_input)\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/f14c03dd-a86f-4efa-b72b-f723390f26cb/tmp/1e5d4784-645a-40ef-adbd-1eee7b5e62d6/submission.py\", line 217, in init\n    variables = self.model.init(\n                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/f14c03dd-a86f-4efa-b72b-f723390f26cb/tmp/1e5d4784-645a-40ef-adbd-1eee7b5e62d6/submission.py\"\
    , line 90, in __call__\n    temporal_encoder = nn.vmap(\n                       ^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/flax/linen/kw_only_dataclasses.py\", line 235, in init_wrapper\n    dataclass_init(self, *args, **kwargs)\nTypeError: VmapTemporalEncoder.__init__() got an unexpected keyword argument 'training'\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'MoE: CNN Temporal Encoder, Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts' submitted for Research Task #1: Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench. Evaluation ID: 53.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\
    \n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 53 | 1 | MoE: CNN Temporal Encoder, Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts | Aether I | 33 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 46 | 1 | MoE: Global Context Gating, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts | Aether I | 30 | -0.028066 | 0.0197 | 0.0292 | 0.0310 | 0.0234 | 0.0264 |\n| 39 | 1 | MoE: Global Context Gating, H128, Embed8, 8 Experts | Aether I | 27 | -0.028426 | 0.0197 | 0.0297 | 0.0315 | 0.0233 | 0.0265 |\n| 35 | 1 | Global Context MLP: LR 0.0005, Hidden 128, Embed 8 | Aether I | 24 | -0.028624 | 0.0197 | 0.0299 | 0.0316 | 0.0233 | 0.0267 |\n| 28 | 1 | Global Context MLP: Hidden Size 128,\
    \ Embedding Dim 8 | Aether I | 21 | -0.028575 | 0.0197 | 0.0299 | 0.0315 | 0.0233 | 0.0266 |\n| 24 | 1 | Global Context MLP: Embedding Dim 4 | Aether I | 19 | -0.028688 | 0.0198 | 0.0300 | 0.0318 | 0.0235 | 0.0267 |\n| 18 | 1 | Shared MLP with Embeddings, Bias, and Global Context | Aether I | 16 | -0.028592 | 0.0197 | 0.0298 | 0.0315 | 0.0234 | 0.0267 |\n| 10 | 1 | Shared-Neuron MLP with Embeddings and Bias | Aether I | 13 | -0.028772 | 0.0196 | 0.0300 | 0.0319 | 0.0234 | 0.0267 |\n| 4 | 1 | Shared-Neuron MLP with Per-Neuron Bias | Aether I | 9 | -0.029191 | 0.0198 | 0.0305 | 0.0323 | 0.0237 | 0.0271 |\n| 1 | 1 | Shared-Neuron MLP Baseline | System | 0 | -0.029954 | 0.0198 | 0.0312 | 0.0338 | 0.0239 | 0.0275 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating\
    \ the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
