    \ Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 56 | 1 | MoE: Fixed CNN Temporal Encoder, Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts | Aether I | 34 | -0.028151 | 0.0198 | 0.0293 | 0.0310 | 0.0234 | 0.0265 |\n| 53 | 1 | MoE: CNN Temporal Encoder, Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts | Aether I | 33 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 46 | 1 | MoE: Global Context Gating, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts | Aether I | 30 | -0.028066 | 0.0197 | 0.0292 | 0.0310 | 0.0234 | 0.0264 |\n| 39 | 1\
    \ | MoE: Global Context Gating, H128, Embed8, 8 Experts | Aether I | 27 | -0.028426 | 0.0197 | 0.0297 | 0.0315 | 0.0233 | 0.0265 |\n| 35 | 1 | Global Context MLP: LR 0.0005, Hidden 128, Embed 8 | Aether I | 24 | -0.028624 | 0.0197 | 0.0299 | 0.0316 | 0.0233 | 0.0267 |\n| 28 | 1 | Global Context MLP: Hidden Size 128, Embedding Dim 8 | Aether I | 21 | -0.028575 | 0.0197 | 0.0299 | 0.0315 | 0.0233 | 0.0266 |\n| 24 | 1 | Global Context MLP: Embedding Dim 4 | Aether I | 19 | -0.028688 | 0.0198 | 0.0300 | 0.0318 | 0.0235 | 0.0267 |\n| 18 | 1 | Shared MLP with Embeddings, Bias, and Global Context | Aether I | 16 | -0.028592 | 0.0197 | 0.0298 | 0.0315 | 0.0234 | 0.0267 |\n| 10 | 1 | Shared-Neuron MLP with Embeddings and Bias | Aether I | 13 | -0.028772 | 0.0196 | 0.0300 | 0.0319 | 0.0234 | 0.0267 |\n| 4 | 1 | Shared-Neuron MLP with Per-Neuron Bias | Aether I | 9 | -0.029191 | 0.0198 | 0.0305 | 0.0323 | 0.0237 | 0.0271 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate\
    \ pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
