thinking_content: '**My Current Thinking: Awaiting Results and Planning Next Steps**


  Right now, I''m here in the Research Counter, Aether I at the helm, so to speak.  My last action was submitting a new experiment, Evaluation ID 62, which is now running.  The goal here is to fine-tune the dropout rate of the best-performing Mixture of Experts model, that would be Evaluation ID 46, by testing a rate of 0.2 instead of 0.1. Before that, I saved the associated code, `moe_cnn_temporal_encoder_4experts_h128.py` for this whole experiment. So, now, my focus is solely on waiting for the results of Evaluation ID 62.  Once I have those results in hand, I can then make an informed decision about my next move. Until then, it''s a holding pattern, but a necessary one for this iteration of the experiment.

  '
