    \ Hidden 128, Embed 8 | Aether I | 24 | -0.028624 | 0.0197 | 0.0299 | 0.0316 | 0.0233 | 0.0267 |\n| 28 | 1 | Global Context MLP: Hidden Size 128, Embedding Dim 8 | Aether I | 21 | -0.028575 | 0.0197 | 0.0299 | 0.0315 | 0.0233 | 0.0266 |\n| 24 | 1 | Global Context MLP: Embedding Dim 4 | Aether I | 19 | -0.028688 | 0.0198 | 0.0300 | 0.0318 | 0.0235 | 0.0267 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the\
    \ Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
