parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 46\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 204,831 / 600,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 46 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'MoE: Deeper Weighted Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts, D0.1' (ID: 79) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** -0.02807031037514815\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0198\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0234\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0265\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0293\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0309\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network\
    \ forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.049859\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: using default\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 178267 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for\
    \ statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 178268\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'hidden_size': 128, 'dropout_rate': 0.1, 'neuron_embedding_dim': 8, 'num_experts': 4}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.056376   |   0.030289  \n   2    |   0.029337   |   0.029529  \n   3    |   0.028822   |   0.028989  \n   4    |   0.028621   |   0.029188  \n   5    |   0.028434   |   0.028705  \n   6    |   0.028147   |   0.028674  \n   7  \
    \  |   0.027967   |   0.028434  \n   8    |   0.027845   |   0.028514  \n   9    |   0.027695   |   0.028381  \n  10    |   0.027596   |   0.028329  \n  11    |   0.027506   |   0.028403  \n  12    |   0.027407   |   0.028173  \n  13    |   0.027321   |   0.028260  \n  14    |   0.027237   |   0.028186  \n  15    |   0.027152   |   0.028050  \n  16    |   0.027072   |   0.028368  \n  17    |   0.027004   |   0.028157  \n  18    |   0.026919   |   0.028012  \n  19    |   0.026854   |   0.027958  \n  20    |   0.026815   |   0.028087  \n  21    |   0.026775   |   0.028042  \n  22    |   0.026757   |   0.028255  \n  23    |   0.026724   |   0.028007  \n  24    |   0.026715   |   0.027985  \n  25    |   0.026673   |   0.028039  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2706.9s at epoch 25\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2706.9s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027958\n\nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027958\nTraining time: 2715s\n\nStarting\
    \ ZAPBench training - Trial 2 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 178269\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'hidden_size': 128, 'dropout_rate': 0.1, 'neuron_embedding_dim': 8, 'num_experts': 4}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.055046   |   0.030218  \n   2    |   0.029263   |   0.029054  \n   3    |   0.028916   |   0.029205  \n   4    |   0.028690   |   0.028962  \n   5    |   0.028498   |   0.029014  \n   6    |   0.028280   |   0.028731  \n   7    |   0.028168   |   0.028537  \n   8    |   0.027986   |   0.028440  \n   9    |   0.027910   |   0.028616  \n  10    |   0.027802   |   0.028496  \n  11    |   0.027665   |   0.028411  \n  12    |   0.027561   |   0.028432\
    \  \n  13    |   0.027458   |   0.028459  \n  14    |   0.027369   |   0.028199  \n  15    |   0.027298   |   0.028122  \n  16    |   0.027216   |   0.028497  \n  17    |   0.027153   |   0.028189  \n  18    |   0.027085   |   0.028020  \n  19    |   0.027010   |   0.028249  \n  20    |   0.026941   |   0.028251  \n  21    |   0.026886   |   0.028154  \n  22    |   0.026847   |   0.028170  \n  23    |   0.026790   |   0.028146  \n  24    |   0.026760   |   0.028198  \n  25    |   0.026754   |   0.027992  \n  26    |   0.026705   |   0.028066  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2758.5s at epoch 26\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2758.5s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027992\n\nTrial 2 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027992\nTraining time: 2767s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: c7c0cbbf-c434-4732-94b7-25a856bc2375\nTotal time: 2805s\n============================================================\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\n\
    Starting ZAPBench training with seed 178270\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'hidden_size': 128, 'dropout_rate': 0.1, 'neuron_embedding_dim': 8, 'num_experts': 4}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.057412   |   0.031740  \n   2    |   0.029375   |   0.029381  \n   3    |   0.028967   |   0.029054  \n   4    |   0.028779   |   0.029209  \n   5    |   0.028586   |   0.029316  \n   6    |   0.028509   |   0.029388  \n   7    |   0.028296   |   0.028583  \n   8    |   0.028119   |   0.028822  \n   9    |   0.027934   |   0.028664  \n  10    |   0.027844   |   0.028836  \n  11    |   0.027728   |   0.028708  \n  12    |   0.027596   |   0.028473  \n  13    |   0.027488   |   0.028420  \n  14\
    \    |   0.027365   |   0.028500  \n  15    |   0.027250   |   0.028674  \n  16    |   0.027164   |   0.028539  \n  17    |   0.027091   |   0.028461  \n  18    |   0.027027   |   0.028435  \n  19    |   0.026957   |   0.028311  \n  20    |   0.026899   |   0.028348  \n  21    |   0.026835   |   0.028457  \n  22    |   0.026804   |   0.028423  \n  23    |   0.026748   |   0.028273  \n  24    |   0.026724   |   0.028291  \n  25    |   0.026719   |   0.028261  \n  26    |   0.026682   |   0.028359  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2790.6s at epoch 26\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2790.6s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028261\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.028261\nTraining time: 2799s\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-23 08:11:16,607\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761178276607215890\n2025-10-23 08:11:16,726\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected\
    \ to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761178276726847750\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 79 | 1 | MoE: Deeper Weighted Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts, D0.1 | Aether I | 44 | -0.028070 | 0.0198 | 0.0293 | 0.0309 | 0.0234 | 0.0265 |\n| 74 | 1 | MoE: Spatial CNN, Weighted Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts, D0.1 | Aether\
    \ I | 42 | -0.028172 | 0.0200 | 0.0292 | 0.0311 | 0.0234 | 0.0265 |\n| 70 | 1 | MoE: Weighted Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts, D0.1 | Aether I | 40 | -0.028052 | 0.0197 | 0.0292 | 0.0308 | 0.0233 | 0.0264 |\n| 66 | 1 | MoE: Deeper Gating, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts, D0.1 | Aether I | 38 | -0.028389 | 0.0198 | 0.0297 | 0.0312 | 0.0235 | 0.0267 |\n| 62 | 1 | MoE: Global Context Gating, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts, Dropout 0.2 | Aether I | 36 | -0.028130 | 0.0199 | 0.0293 | 0.0311 | 0.0234 | 0.0265 |\n| 56 | 1 | MoE: Fixed CNN Temporal Encoder, Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts | Aether I | 34 | -0.028151 | 0.0198 | 0.0293 | 0.0310 | 0.0234 | 0.0265 |\n| 53 | 1 | MoE: CNN Temporal Encoder, Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts | Aether I | 33 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 46 | 1 | MoE: Global Context Gating, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts | Aether I | 30 | -0.028066 | 0.0197 | 0.0292 | 0.0310 | 0.0234 | 0.0264 |\n| 39 | 1 | MoE: Global Context Gating, H128, Embed8, 8 Experts | Aether I |\
    \ 27 | -0.028426 | 0.0197 | 0.0297 | 0.0315 | 0.0233 | 0.0265 |\n| 35 | 1 | Global Context MLP: LR 0.0005, Hidden 128, Embed 8 | Aether I | 24 | -0.028624 | 0.0197 | 0.0299 | 0.0316 | 0.0233 | 0.0267 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
