parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 50\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 232,816 / 600,000 used (39%)\n- Agent Age: 50 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'MoE: Flattened Temporal CNN (32 Ch), Weighted Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts, D0.1' (ID: 90) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** -0.027970937415600503\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0196\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0232\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0262\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0290\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0311\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network\
    \ creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.012450\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: using default\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 187192 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\n\
    Configuration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 2 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 187194\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'hidden_size': 128, 'dropout_rate': 0.1, 'neuron_embedding_dim': 8, 'temporal_conv_channels': 32, 'temporal_kernel_size': 3, 'num_experts': 4}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.047950   |   0.030439  \n   2    |   0.029147   |   0.029099  \n   3    |   0.028788   |   0.028881  \n   4    |   0.028567   |   0.028878  \n  \
    \ 5    |   0.028441   |   0.028775  \n   6    |   0.028349   |   0.028669  \n   7    |   0.028248   |   0.028505  \n   8    |   0.028095   |   0.028537  \n   9    |   0.027940   |   0.028657  \n  10    |   0.027801   |   0.028413  \n  11    |   0.027674   |   0.028533  \n  12    |   0.027618   |   0.028677  \n  13    |   0.027562   |   0.028547  \n  14    |   0.027512   |   0.028317  \n  15    |   0.027472   |   0.028232  \n  16    |   0.027444   |   0.028383  \n  17    |   0.027366   |   0.028250  \n  18    |   0.027310   |   0.028136  \n  19    |   0.027272   |   0.028254  \n  20    |   0.027237   |   0.028096  \n  21    |   0.027207   |   0.028410  \n  22    |   0.027166   |   0.028183  \n  23    |   0.027143   |   0.028162  \n  24    |   0.027090   |   0.027944  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2772.9s at epoch 24\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2772.9s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027944\n\nTrial 2 completed:\nValidation MAE:\
    \ 0.027944\nTraining time: 2782s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 187195\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'hidden_size': 128, 'dropout_rate': 0.1, 'neuron_embedding_dim': 8, 'temporal_conv_channels': 32, 'temporal_kernel_size': 3, 'num_experts': 4}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.045127   |   0.029923  \n   2    |   0.029341   |   0.029952  \n   3    |   0.028824   |   0.030269  \n   4    |   0.028642   |   0.028806  \n   5    |   0.028521   |   0.028871  \n   6    |   0.028421   |   0.028681  \n   7    |   0.028304   |   0.029060  \n   8    |   0.028225   |   0.028597  \n   9    |   0.028084   |   0.028572  \n  10  \
