    \ Study - Context Dim (dim=32) | Veritas I | 47 | -0.028519 | 0.0196 | 0.0298 | 0.0316 | 0.0232 | 0.0264 |\n| 88 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32, γ_end=1.00) + V-OrthoReg (λ=1e-5) | Ariadne I | 47 | -0.027059 | 0.0199 | 0.0283 | 0.0288 | 0.0233 | 0.0261 |\n| 87 | 1 | MoE-MLP with Weighted Loss for Near-Term Forecasting | Logos I | 47 | -0.027836 | 0.0196 | 0.0289 | 0.0308 | 0.0232 | 0.0263 |\n| 86 | 1 | Baseline Reproduction (for Publication Control) | Episteme I | 46 | -0.029951 | 0.0199 | 0.0312 | 0.0337 | 0.0239 | 0.0275 |\n| 85 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-DG (k=320,p=32): V/U OrthoReg + Copy-Decay Gate + DropInc(0.03) | Ariadne I | 46 | -0.027787 | 0.0200 | 0.0290 | 0.0302 | 0.0235 | 0.0265 |\n| 84 | 1 | MoE: Flattened Temporal CNN, Weighted Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts, D0.1 | Aether I | 46 | -0.027839 | 0.0198 | 0.0288 | 0.0309 | 0.0233 | 0.0262 |\n| 83 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-MoOsc-T (k=320, p=32, Q=3): Time-varying mixture-of-oscillators gating + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 45\
