- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 51\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 241,555 / 600,000 used (40%)\n- Agent Age: 51 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 83**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Osc2-CTX-FLoad-MoOsc-T (k=320, p=32, Q=3): Time-varying mixture-of-oscillators gating + V-OrthoReg\n**ID:** 83\n**Tags:** state-space, oscillatory, time-varying, factorized-loadings, mixture, forecasting\n**Abstract:** Extends MoOsc by making the per-factor mixture-of-oscillators gating depend on prediction step t (learned per-t logits) in addition to mean/velocity context. Produces per-(b,t,k) dynamics inside scan. Retains residual copy, temporal/horizon gating, curvature loss, and V-orthogonality (λ=1e-5).\n**Score:** -0.026994678505957184\n**Val_MAE_1:**\
    \ 0.0199\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0232\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0260\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0282\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0288\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\n\nimport optax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom models_moosc_t import Osc2CtxFLoadMoOscT\nfrom losses import mae_with_temporal_curvature\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\nBATCH_SIZE = 8\nV_ORTHO_LAM = 1e-5  # ||V^T V - I||_F^2\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        'rank_k': 320,\n        'proj_rank': 32,\n        'num_prototypes': 3,\n        'hidden_size': 96,\n        'normalize_u': True,\n        'gamma_start': 0.25,\n        'gamma_end': 0.99\n    }\n\nclass Wrapper:\n    def __init__(self, rank_k=320, proj_rank=32, num_prototypes=3, hidden_size=96, normalize_u=True, gamma_start=0.25, gamma_end=0.99):\n        self.model = Osc2CtxFLoadMoOscT(\n            rank_k=rank_k,\n         \
    \   proj_rank=proj_rank,\n            num_prototypes=num_prototypes,\n            hidden_size=hidden_size,\n            normalize_u=normalize_u,\n            gamma_start=gamma_start,\n            gamma_end=gamma_end\n        )\n        self.needs_rng = False\n\n    def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n        return self.model.init(rng_key, dummy_input, training=True)\n\n    def apply(self, params, x, training=False, mutable=None, rngs=None):\n        return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training)\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return Wrapper(\n        rank_k=int(hparams.get('rank_k', 320)),\n        proj_rank=int(hparams.get('proj_rank', 32)),\n        num_prototypes=int(hparams.get('num_prototypes', 3)),\n        hidden_size=int(hparams.get('hidden_size', 96)),\n        normalize_u=bool(hparams.get('normalize_u', True)),\n        gamma_start=float(hparams.get('gamma_start', 0.25)),\n        gamma_end=float(hparams.get('gamma_end', 0.99))\n    )\n\ndef compute_loss(predictions,\
    \ targets, params, x):\n    # Base MAE + temporal curvature penalty\n    base = mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, params, x, lam=1e-4)\n    # V orthogonality penalty: ||V^T V - I||_F^2\n    V = params['params']['V']\n    G = V.T @ V\n    I = jnp.eye(G.shape[0], dtype=G.dtype)\n    ortho = jnp.sum((G - I) ** 2)\n    return base + V_ORTHO_LAM * ortho\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate, eps=1e-8)\n    )\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000033\nTesting training\
    \ step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting\
    \ Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 2 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 44\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32, 'num_prototypes': 3, 'hidden_size': 96, 'normalize_u': True, 'gamma_start': 0.25, 'gamma_end': 0.99}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.029844   |   0.028807  \n   2    |   0.027907   |   0.029116  \n   3    |   0.027193   |   0.028029  \n   4    |   0.026624   |   0.027709  \n   5    |   0.026293   |   0.027992  \n   6    |   0.026076   |   0.027531  \n   7    |   0.025855   |   0.027480  \n   8    |   0.025683   |   0.027659  \n   9    |   0.025501   |   0.027657  \n  10    |   0.025350   |  \
    \ 0.027317  \n  11    |   0.025210   |   0.027255  \n  12    |   0.025100   |   0.027262  \n  13    |   0.024979   |   0.027217  \n  14    |   0.024858   |   0.027386  \n  15    |   0.024785   |   0.027462  \n  16    |   0.024710   |   0.027258  \n  17    |   0.024647   |   0.027351  \n  18    |   0.024597   |   0.027257  \n  19    |   0.024507   |   0.027093  \n  20    |   0.024495   |   0.027308  \n  21    |   0.024426   |   0.027198  \n  22    |   0.024420   |   0.027459  \n  23    |   0.024349   |   0.027051  \n  24    |   0.024323   |   0.027333  \n  25    |   0.024314   |   0.026961  \n  26    |   0.024255   |   0.027168  \n  27    |   0.024234   |   0.027322  \n  28    |   0.024227   |   0.027354  \n  29    |   0.024208   |   0.027034  \n  30    |   0.024181   |   0.027350  \n  31    |   0.024154   |   0.027291  \n  32    |   0.024118   |   0.027460  \n  33    |   0.024116   |   0.027307  \n  34    |   0.024097   |   0.027248  \n  35    |   0.024093   |   0.027105  \n  36    |\
