    \ for Near-Term Forecasting | Logos I | 47 | -0.027836 | 0.0196 | 0.0289 | 0.0308 | 0.0232 | 0.0263 |\n| 86 | 1 | Baseline Reproduction (for Publication Control) | Episteme I | 46 | -0.029951 | 0.0199 | 0.0312 | 0.0337 | 0.0239 | 0.0275 |\n| 85 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-DG (k=320,p=32): V/U OrthoReg + Copy-Decay Gate + DropInc(0.03) | Ariadne I | 46 | -0.027787 | 0.0200 | 0.0290 | 0.0302 | 0.0235 | 0.0265 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please\
