parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 52\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 253,325 / 600,000 used (42%)\n- Agent Age: 52 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDon't give up easily—leaving the station before 75% token usage generally indicates insufficient exploration and persistence. True researchers don't escape failure but explore around it to achieve breakthrough.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write aether/models/moe_flattened_temporal_cnn_sota.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `storage read storage/ariadne/losses.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File overwritten successfully: aether/models/moe_flattened_temporal_cnn_sota.py\n\
    - File content for storage/ariadne/losses.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 97 | 1 | Latent Dynamics Model (Inspired by SOTA) | Logos I | 52 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 96 | 1 | Ablation Study: MoE with MLP Gater | Episteme I | 51 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 95 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99): LayerNorm + Wider Increment + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 51 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 94 | 1 | Veritas I: Contextual ConvNeuronEmbeddingMLP with Temporal Conv in Context | Veritas I | 50 | -0.028418 | 0.0195 | 0.0297\
    \ | 0.0315 | 0.0231 | 0.0264 |\n| 93 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg (λ=1e-5) | Ariadne I | 50 | -0.026958 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0289 | 0.0233 | 0.0260 |\n| 92 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.99): LayerNorm in factor space + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 49 | -0.026910 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 91 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.985) + V-OrthoReg (λ=1e-5) | Ariadne I | 48 | -0.027037 | 0.0199 | 0.0283 | 0.0288 | 0.0233 | 0.0261 |\n| 90 | 1 | MoE: Flattened Temporal CNN (32 Ch), Weighted Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts, D0.1 | Aether I | 48 | -0.027971 | 0.0196 | 0.0290 | 0.0311 | 0.0232 | 0.0262 |\n| 89 | 1 | Veritas I: Ablation Study - Context Dim (dim=32) | Veritas I | 47 | -0.028519 | 0.0196 | 0.0298 | 0.0316 | 0.0232 | 0.0264 |\n| 88 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32, γ_end=1.00) + V-OrthoReg (λ=1e-5) | Ariadne I | 47 | -0.027059 | 0.0199 | 0.0283 | 0.0288 | 0.0233 | 0.0261 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted\
    \ by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/ariadne/losses.py:**\n```\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\n\ndef mae_with_ortho(predictions, targets, params, x, lam_l2=1e-6, lam_ortho=5e-4):\n    \"\"\"\n    MAE + regularization on low-rank loadings:\n      - L2 on loadings to stabilize scale\n      - Orthogonality penalty on columns of L via ||L^T L - I||_F^2\n    \"\"\"\n    mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n\n    # Extract parameter tree that contains 'loadings'\n    if isinstance(params, dict) and 'params' in params:\n        p = params['params']\n    else:\n        p = params\n\n    L = p.get('loadings', None)\n    if L is None:\n        return mae\n\n    # L2 penalty on loadings\n    reg = lam_l2 * jnp.mean(L * L)\n\n    # Orthogonality penalty (encourages diverse factors)\n\
    \    k = L.shape[-1]\n    gram = jnp.matmul(L.T, L)\n    I = jnp.eye(k, dtype=L.dtype)\n    ortho = gram - I\n    reg += lam_ortho * jnp.mean(ortho * ortho)\n\n    return mae + reg\n\ndef mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, params, x, lam=1e-4):\n    \"\"\"\n    MAE + temporal curvature regularization on predictions across horizon.\n    Curvature penalty: mean over batch/neurons of (y_t - 2*y_{t-1} + y_{t-2})^2, t>=2.\n    This encourages smooth trajectories over the 32-step forecast horizon.\n    \"\"\"\n    mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n    # Second differences along time dimension\n    curv = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n    curv_pen = jnp.mean(curv * curv)\n    return mae + lam * curv_pen\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help\
    \ research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
