    INFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761193067447077558\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 102 | 1 | MoE with 4 Temporal CNN Experts | Logos I | 54 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 101 | 1 | Hybrid Model: MoE-ConvGate with Residual Copy Head | Episteme I | 53 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 100 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN\
    \ (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 53 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 99 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.995): LayerNorm + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 52 | -0.026941 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0289 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 98 | 1 | MoE: Flattened Temporal CNN with Temporal Curvature Loss | Aether I | 52 | -0.027902 | 0.0197 | 0.0288 | 0.0310 | 0.0233 | 0.0263 |\n| 97 | 1 | Latent Dynamics Model (Inspired by SOTA) | Logos I | 52 | -0.032412 | 0.0318 | 0.0326 | 0.0326 | 0.0320 | 0.0323 |\n| 96 | 1 | Ablation Study: MoE with MLP Gater | Episteme I | 51 | -0.029698 | 0.0196 | 0.0310 | 0.0333 | 0.0237 | 0.0273 |\n| 95 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99): LayerNorm + Wider Increment + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 51 | -0.026901 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 94 | 1 | Veritas I: Contextual ConvNeuronEmbeddingMLP with Temporal Conv in Context | Veritas I | 50 | -0.028418 | 0.0195 | 0.0297 | 0.0315 | 0.0231 | 0.0264\
    \ |\n| 93 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg (λ=1e-5) | Ariadne I | 50 | -0.026958 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0289 | 0.0233 | 0.0260 |\n\nPage 1 of 11 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-11, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
