role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 57\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 284,926 / 600,000 used (47%)\n- Agent Age: 57 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 102**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** MoE with 4 Temporal CNN Experts\n**ID:** 102\n**Tags:** mixture-of-experts, moe, cnn, temporal-features, spatial-features\n**Abstract:** This submission returns to the successful MoE framework and aims to improve it by enhancing the experts. It combines the SOTA 4-expert architecture (ID 65) with the efficient temporal 1D CNN expert design from experiment ID 17. The hypothesis is that replacing the simple MLP experts with more powerful, yet still computationally efficient, temporal CNN experts will provide a significant performance boost, creating a new\
    \ SOTA model that leverages both spatial gating and expert-level temporal processing.\n**Score:** -0.02778873650804081\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0195\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0232\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0262\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0289\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0307\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax import random\n\nNUM_NEURONS = 71721\nINPUT_HORIZON = 4\nOUTPUT_HORIZON = 32\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    # Combining best elements: 4 experts, spatial gater, and temporal CNN experts\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        'embedding_dim': 8,\n        'num_experts': 4,\n        'gating_hidden_dim': 32,\n        'gating_cnn_features': 16,\n        'gating_cnn_kernel_size': 128,\n        'gating_pool_window': 256,\n        'expert_cnn_features': 32,\n        'expert_cnn_kernel_size': 2,\n        'expert_mlp_hidden_size': 64,\n        'expert_dropout_rate':\
    \ 0.1,\n    }\n\nclass CnnExpert(nn.Module):\n    embedding_dim: int\n    cnn_features: int\n    cnn_kernel_size: int\n    mlp_hidden_size: int\n    dropout_rate: float\n\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, training: bool = False):\n        # This is the temporal CNN expert from ID 17\n        batch_size = x.shape[0]\n        neuron_indices = jnp.arange(NUM_NEURONS)\n        embeddings = nn.Embed(num_embeddings=NUM_NEURONS, features=self.embedding_dim, name=\"neuron_embed\")(neuron_indices)\n        broadcasted_embeddings = jnp.broadcast_to(embeddings, (batch_size, NUM_NEURONS, self.embedding_dim))\n        x_transposed = jnp.transpose(x, (0, 2, 1))\n        x_reshaped = jnp.expand_dims(x_transposed, axis=-1)\n        broadcasted_embeddings_seq = jnp.expand_dims(broadcasted_embeddings, axis=2)\n        broadcasted_embeddings_seq = jnp.broadcast_to(broadcasted_embeddings_seq, (batch_size, NUM_NEURONS, INPUT_HORIZON, self.embedding_dim))\n        combined_input = jnp.concatenate([x_reshaped,\
    \ broadcasted_embeddings_seq], axis=-1)\n        cnn_input = jnp.reshape(combined_input, (batch_size * NUM_NEURONS, INPUT_HORIZON, 1 + self.embedding_dim))\n        y = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_features, kernel_size=(self.cnn_kernel_size,))(cnn_input)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        y = y.reshape((y.shape[0], -1))\n        y = nn.Dense(self.mlp_hidden_size)(y)\n        y = nn.BatchNorm(use_running_average=not training)(y)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        y = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate, deterministic=not training)(y)\n        output = nn.Dense(OUTPUT_HORIZON)(y)\n        output = jnp.reshape(output, (batch_size, NUM_NEURONS, OUTPUT_HORIZON))\n        output = jnp.transpose(output, (0, 2, 1))\n        return output\n\nclass CnnGatingNetwork(nn.Module):\n    num_experts: int\n    hidden_dim: int\n    cnn_features: int\n    cnn_kernel_size: int\n    pool_window: int\n\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        gater_input = jnp.transpose(x, (0, 2, 1))\n        y = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_features,\
    \ kernel_size=(self.cnn_kernel_size,))(gater_input)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        y = nn.max_pool(y, window_shape=(self.pool_window,), strides=(self.pool_window,))\n        y = y.reshape((y.shape[0], -1))\n        y = nn.Dense(features=self.hidden_dim)(y)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        logits = nn.Dense(features=self.num_experts)(y)\n        return nn.softmax(logits, axis=-1)\n\nclass MoEModel(nn.Module):\n    num_experts: int\n    expert_params: dict\n    gating_params: dict\n    \n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, training: bool = False):\n        experts = nn.vmap(\n            CnnExpert, in_axes=None, out_axes=1,\n            variable_axes={'params': 0, 'batch_stats': 0},\n            split_rngs={'params': True, 'dropout': True},\n            axis_size=self.num_experts\n        )(**self.expert_params, name=\"experts\")\n        \n        gating_network = CnnGatingNetwork(**self.gating_params, name=\"gating\")\n        gating_weights = gating_network(x)\n        \n \
    \       expert_outputs = experts(x, training=training)\n        \n        gating_weights_reshaped = jnp.expand_dims(jnp.expand_dims(gating_weights, -1), -1)\n        \n        final_output = jnp.sum(expert_outputs * gating_weights_reshaped, axis=1)\n        return final_output\n\nclass ModelWrapper:\n    def __init__(self, hparams):\n        self.hparams = hparams\n        expert_params = {\n            'embedding_dim': hparams.get('embedding_dim'),\n            'cnn_features': hparams.get('expert_cnn_features'),\n            'cnn_kernel_size': hparams.get('expert_cnn_kernel_size'),\n            'mlp_hidden_size': hparams.get('expert_mlp_hidden_size'),\n            'dropout_rate': hparams.get('expert_dropout_rate'),\n        }\n        gating_params = {\n            'num_experts': hparams.get('num_experts'),\n            'hidden_dim': hparams.get('gating_hidden_dim'),\n            'cnn_features': hparams.get('gating_cnn_features'),\n            'cnn_kernel_size': hparams.get('gating_cnn_kernel_size'),\n\
    \            'pool_window': hparams.get('gating_pool_window'),\n        }\n        self.model = MoEModel(num_experts=hparams.get('num_experts'), expert_params=expert_params, gating_params=gating_params)\n        self.mutable = ['batch_stats']\n        self.needs_rng = True\n\n    def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n        rng_params, rng_dropout = random.split(rng_key)\n        return self.model.init({'params': rng_params, 'dropout': rng_dropout}, dummy_input, training=True)\n\n    def apply(self, params, x, training=False, mutable=None, rngs=None):\n        if mutable:\n            return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training, mutable=mutable, rngs=rngs)\n        return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training, rngs=rngs)\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return ModelWrapper(hparams)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION\
    \ ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.067500\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: using default\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 197914 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\n\
    Starting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 197917\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'embedding_dim': 8, 'num_experts': 4, 'gating_hidden_dim': 32, 'gating_cnn_features': 16, 'gating_cnn_kernel_size': 128, 'gating_pool_window': 256, 'expert_cnn_features': 32, 'expert_cnn_kernel_size': 2, 'expert_mlp_hidden_size': 64, 'expert_dropout_rate': 0.1}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n\
