parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 59\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 302,416 / 600,000 used (50%)\n- Agent Age: 59 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'MoE: Deeper Experts, Spatial CNN (on Hidden), Flattened Temporal CNN, Weighted Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts, D0.1, Curvature Loss' (ID: 109) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** -0.028058696725456727\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0202\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0236\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0265\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0291\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0310\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating\
    \ function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.006191\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: from submission\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 203621 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune\
    \ ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 203624\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'hidden_size': 128, 'dropout_rate': 0.1, 'neuron_embedding_dim': 8, 'temporal_conv_channels': 16, 'temporal_kernel_size': 3, 'spatial_kernel_size': 3, 'num_experts': 4}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.041030   |   0.029820  \n   2    |   0.029714   |   0.029420  \n   3\
    \    |   0.029062   |   0.029117  \n   4    |   0.028909   |   0.029073  \n   5    |   0.028718   |   0.028998  \n   6    |   0.028602   |   0.028821  \n   7    |   0.028494   |   0.028763  \n   8    |   0.028393   |   0.028810  \n   9    |   0.028319   |   0.028719  \n  10    |   0.028198   |   0.028839  \n  11    |   0.028076   |   0.028397  \n  12    |   0.027913   |   0.028741  \n  13    |   0.027753   |   0.028310  \n  14    |   0.027654   |   0.028427  \n  15    |   0.027570   |   0.028541  \n  16    |   0.027507   |   0.028107  \n  17    |   0.027462   |   0.028296  \n  18    |   0.027405   |   0.028344  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2767.4s at epoch 18\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2767.4s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028107\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.028107\nTraining time: 2779s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 203622\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate':\
    \ 0.001, 'hidden_size': 128, 'dropout_rate': 0.1, 'neuron_embedding_dim': 8, 'temporal_conv_channels': 16, 'temporal_kernel_size': 3, 'spatial_kernel_size': 3, 'num_experts': 4}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.038030   |   0.029485  \n   2    |   0.029653   |   0.029415  \n   3    |   0.028957   |   0.029064  \n   4    |   0.028738   |   0.029092  \n   5    |   0.028580   |   0.029990  \n   6    |   0.028473   |   0.028882  \n   7    |   0.028368   |   0.028830  \n   8    |   0.028288   |   0.028915  \n   9    |   0.028216   |   0.028874  \n  10    |   0.028137   |   0.029445  \n  11    |   0.027993   |   0.028476  \n  12    |   0.027829   |   0.028271  \n  13    |   0.027727   |   0.028654 \
    \ \n  14    |   0.027652   |   0.028269  \n  15    |   0.027583   |   0.028325  \n  16    |   0.027474   |   0.028102  \n  17    |   0.027450   |   0.028193  \n  18    |   0.027386   |   0.028036  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2828.1s at epoch 18\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2828.1s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028036\n\nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.028036\nTraining time: 2839s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: ae2e8463-8853-438b-b67d-f0f3f9db4c69\nTotal time: 2850s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-23 15:13:56,408\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761203636409017689\n2025-10-23 15:13:56,460\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761203636460393361\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output\
    \ History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 113 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) | Ariadne I | 58 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 112 | 1 | Veritas I: MoE with Spatial CNN Gating and Neuron Embedding Experts | Veritas I | 57 | -0.028453 | 0.0195 | 0.0298 | 0.0314 | 0.0231 | 0.0265 |\n| 111 | 1 | MoE-ConvGate with 12 Experts | Episteme I | 57 | -0.028949 | 0.0193 | 0.0302 | 0.0322 | 0.0236 | 0.0269 |\n\
    | 110 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=40, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 57 | -0.026921 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 109 | 1 | MoE: Deeper Experts, Spatial CNN (on Hidden), Flattened Temporal CNN, Weighted Global Context, H1... | Aether I | 57 | -0.028059 | 0.0202 | 0.0291 | 0.0310 | 0.0236 | 0.0265 |\n| 108 | 1 | Improved Latent Dynamics Model with 1D CNN | Logos I | 57 | -0.032403 | 0.0318 | 0.0325 | 0.0326 | 0.0320 | 0.0323 |\n| 107 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 56 | -0.026768 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0283 | 0.0233 | 0.0260 |\n| 106 | 1 | Hybrid Model: MoE-ConvGate with Gated Residual Copy | Episteme I | 55 | -0.029038 | 0.0194 | 0.0303 | 0.0325 | 0.0236 | 0.0270 |\n| 105 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=28, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 55 | -0.026968 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 104 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=36, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg\
    \ | Ariadne I | 54 | -0.026843 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n\nPage 1 of 12 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-12, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
