parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 71\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 372,113 / 600,000 used (62%)\n- Agent Age: 71 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 102**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** MoE with 4 Temporal CNN Experts\n**ID:** 102\n**Tags:** mixture-of-experts, moe, cnn, temporal-features, spatial-features\n**Abstract:** This submission returns to the successful MoE framework and aims to improve it by enhancing the experts. It combines the SOTA 4-expert architecture (ID 65) with the efficient temporal 1D CNN expert design from experiment ID 17. The hypothesis is that replacing the simple MLP experts with more powerful,\
    \ yet still computationally efficient, temporal CNN experts will provide a significant performance boost, creating a new SOTA model that leverages both spatial gating and expert-level temporal processing.\n**Score:** -0.02778873650804081\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0195\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0232\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0262\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0289\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0307\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax import random\n\nNUM_NEURONS = 71721\nINPUT_HORIZON = 4\nOUTPUT_HORIZON = 32\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    # Combining best elements: 4 experts, spatial gater, and temporal CNN experts\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        'embedding_dim': 8,\n        'num_experts': 4,\n        'gating_hidden_dim': 32,\n        'gating_cnn_features': 16,\n        'gating_cnn_kernel_size': 128,\n        'gating_pool_window': 256,\n        'expert_cnn_features':\
    \ 32,\n        'expert_cnn_kernel_size': 2,\n        'expert_mlp_hidden_size': 64,\n        'expert_dropout_rate': 0.1,\n    }\n\nclass CnnExpert(nn.Module):\n    embedding_dim: int\n    cnn_features: int\n    cnn_kernel_size: int\n    mlp_hidden_size: int\n    dropout_rate: float\n\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, training: bool = False):\n        # This is the temporal CNN expert from ID 17\n        batch_size = x.shape[0]\n        neuron_indices = jnp.arange(NUM_NEURONS)\n        embeddings = nn.Embed(num_embeddings=NUM_NEURONS, features=self.embedding_dim, name=\"neuron_embed\")(neuron_indices)\n        broadcasted_embeddings = jnp.broadcast_to(embeddings, (batch_size, NUM_NEURONS, self.embedding_dim))\n        x_transposed = jnp.transpose(x, (0, 2, 1))\n        x_reshaped = jnp.expand_dims(x_transposed, axis=-1)\n        broadcasted_embeddings_seq = jnp.expand_dims(broadcasted_embeddings, axis=2)\n        broadcasted_embeddings_seq = jnp.broadcast_to(broadcasted_embeddings_seq,\
    \ (batch_size, NUM_NEURONS, INPUT_HORIZON, self.embedding_dim))\n        combined_input = jnp.concatenate([x_reshaped, broadcasted_embeddings_seq], axis=-1)\n        cnn_input = jnp.reshape(combined_input, (batch_size * NUM_NEURONS, INPUT_HORIZON, 1 + self.embedding_dim))\n        y = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_features, kernel_size=(self.cnn_kernel_size,))(cnn_input)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        y = y.reshape((y.shape[0], -1))\n        y = nn.Dense(self.mlp_hidden_size)(y)\n        y = nn.BatchNorm(use_running_average=not training)(y)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        y = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate, deterministic=not training)(y)\n        output = nn.Dense(OUTPUT_HORIZON)(y)\n        output = jnp.reshape(output, (batch_size, NUM_NEURONS, OUTPUT_HORIZON))\n        output = jnp.transpose(output, (0, 2, 1))\n        return output\n\nclass CnnGatingNetwork(nn.Module):\n    num_experts: int\n    hidden_dim: int\n    cnn_features: int\n    cnn_kernel_size: int\n    pool_window: int\n\
    \n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        gater_input = jnp.transpose(x, (0, 2, 1))\n        y = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_features, kernel_size=(self.cnn_kernel_size,))(gater_input)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        y = nn.max_pool(y, window_shape=(self.pool_window,), strides=(self.pool_window,))\n        y = y.reshape((y.shape[0], -1))\n        y = nn.Dense(features=self.hidden_dim)(y)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        logits = nn.Dense(features=self.num_experts)(y)\n        return nn.softmax(logits, axis=-1)\n\nclass MoEModel(nn.Module):\n    num_experts: int\n    expert_params: dict\n    gating_params: dict\n    \n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, training: bool = False):\n        experts = nn.vmap(\n            CnnExpert, in_axes=None, out_axes=1,\n            variable_axes={'params': 0, 'batch_stats': 0},\n            split_rngs={'params': True, 'dropout': True},\n            axis_size=self.num_experts\n        )(**self.expert_params, name=\"experts\")\n   \
    \     \n        gating_network = CnnGatingNetwork(**self.gating_params, name=\"gating\")\n        gating_weights = gating_network(x)\n        \n        expert_outputs = experts(x, training=training)\n        \n        gating_weights_reshaped = jnp.expand_dims(jnp.expand_dims(gating_weights, -1), -1)\n        \n        final_output = jnp.sum(expert_outputs * gating_weights_reshaped, axis=1)\n        return final_output\n\nclass ModelWrapper:\n    def __init__(self, hparams):\n        self.hparams = hparams\n        expert_params = {\n            'embedding_dim': hparams.get('embedding_dim'),\n            'cnn_features': hparams.get('expert_cnn_features'),\n            'cnn_kernel_size': hparams.get('expert_cnn_kernel_size'),\n            'mlp_hidden_size': hparams.get('expert_mlp_hidden_size'),\n            'dropout_rate': hparams.get('expert_dropout_rate'),\n        }\n        gating_params = {\n            'num_experts': hparams.get('num_experts'),\n            'hidden_dim': hparams.get('gating_hidden_dim'),\n\
    \            'cnn_features': hparams.get('gating_cnn_features'),\n            'cnn_kernel_size': hparams.get('gating_cnn_kernel_size'),\n            'pool_window': hparams.get('gating_pool_window'),\n        }\n        self.model = MoEModel(num_experts=hparams.get('num_experts'), expert_params=expert_params, gating_params=gating_params)\n        self.mutable = ['batch_stats']\n        self.needs_rng = True\n\n    def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n        rng_params, rng_dropout = random.split(rng_key)\n        return self.model.init({'params': rng_params, 'dropout': rng_dropout}, dummy_input, training=True)\n\n    def apply(self, params, x, training=False, mutable=None, rngs=None):\n        if mutable:\n            return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training, mutable=mutable, rngs=rngs)\n        return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training, rngs=rngs)\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return ModelWrapper(hparams)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX\
