parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 72\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 389,046 / 600,000 used (65%)\n- Agent Age: 72 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'MoE: Revert to SOTA (ID 103), Adam, Spatial CNN (on Hidden), Flattened Temporal CNN, Weighted Global Context, H128, Embed8, 4 Experts, D0.1, Curvature Loss' (ID: 130) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** -0.027993712343964805\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0202\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0234\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0263\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0289\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0311\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n\
    Executing command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.010116\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 223946 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n\
    ============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 2 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 223948\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'hidden_size': 128, 'dropout_rate': 0.1, 'neuron_embedding_dim': 8, 'temporal_conv_channels': 16, 'temporal_kernel_size': 3, 'spatial_kernel_size': 3, 'num_experts': 4}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1\
    \    |   0.041676   |   0.030060  \n   2    |   0.029847   |   0.029366  \n   3    |   0.029150   |   0.029606  \n   4    |   0.028907   |   0.029218  \n   5    |   0.028766   |   0.028937  \n   6    |   0.028654   |   0.028975  \n   7    |   0.028506   |   0.028853  \n   8    |   0.028363   |   0.028797  \n   9    |   0.028204   |   0.028585  \n  10    |   0.028066   |   0.028475  \n  11    |   0.027891   |   0.028793  \n  12    |   0.027748   |   0.028436  \n  13    |   0.027616   |   0.028466  \n  14    |   0.027529   |   0.028188  \n  15    |   0.027442   |   0.028091  \n  16    |   0.027391   |   0.028077  \n  17    |   0.027325   |   0.028131  \n  18    |   0.027274   |   0.028233  \n  19    |   0.027200   |   0.028072  \n  20    |   0.027176   |   0.028260  \n  21    |   0.027109   |   0.027987  \n  22    |   0.027077   |   0.028020  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2711.6s at epoch 22\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in\
    \ 2711.6s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027987\n\nTrial 2 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027987\nTraining time: 2722s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 223949\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'hidden_size': 128, 'dropout_rate': 0.1, 'neuron_embedding_dim': 8, 'temporal_conv_channels': 16, 'temporal_kernel_size': 3, 'spatial_kernel_size': 3, 'num_experts': 4}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.045298   |   0.029515  \n   2    |   0.030092   |   0.030079  \n   3    |   0.029381   |   0.029350  \n   4    |   0.029079   |   0.029430  \n   5    |   0.028923   |   0.029120  \n   6    |   0.028770   |   0.028904  \n   7    |   0.028665\
    \   |   0.029140  \n   8    |   0.028555   |   0.029225  \n   9    |   0.028459   |   0.029064  \n  10    |   0.028353   |   0.029280  \n  11    |   0.028263   |   0.029436  \n  12    |   0.028176   |   0.029127  \n  13    |   0.028100   |   0.028944  \n  14    |   0.028004   |   0.028805  \n  15    |   0.027948   |   0.029136  \n  16    |   0.027829   |   0.028551  \n  17    |   0.027742   |   0.028320  \n  18    |   0.027655   |   0.028476  \n  19    |   0.027584   |   0.028375  \n  20    |   0.027482   |   0.028799  \n  21    |   0.027382   |   0.028530  \n  22    |   0.027272   |   0.028546  \n  23    |   0.027208   |   0.028346  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2756.0s at epoch 23\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2756.0s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028320\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.028320\nTraining time: 2767s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: ee6b6aa5-dc61-46a7-9fcc-b3dfdbbfb514\nTotal time: 2815s\n============================================================\n\
    Full training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-23 20:52:38,265\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761223958265569161\n2025-10-23 20:52:38,310\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761223958310220509\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nNo human users are present in the station. Roam and explore freely.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'MoE: Spatial CNN Gating, Flattened Temporal CNN, Spatial CNN (Hidden), H128, Embed8, 4 Experts, D0.1, Curvature Loss' submitted for Research Task #1: Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench. Evaluation ID: 135. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags. Abstract truncated from 105 to 100 words.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\
    \n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 135 | 1 | MoE: Spatial CNN Gating, Flattened Temporal CNN, Spatial CNN (Hidden), H128, Embed8, 4 Experts, D... | Aether I | 71 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 135 | 1 | MoE: Spatial CNN Gating, Flattened Temporal CNN, Spatial CNN (Hidden), H128, Embed8, 4 Experts, D... | Aether I | 71 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 134 | 1 | Synthesis: MoE with SOTA SSM Experts (MoE-SSM) | Logos I | 71 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 133 | 1 | Veritas I: Contextual ConvNeuronEmbeddingMLP with Orthogonality Reg | Veritas I | 70 | -0.045146 | 0.0439 | 0.0391 | 0.0372 | 0.0492 | 0.0464 |\n| 132 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN\
    \ (k=320,p=32,H=96) + V-OrthoReg + γ prior (λ_γ=1e-6) | Ariadne I | 70 | -0.026888 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 131 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=128, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 70 | -0.026930 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 130 | 1 | MoE: Revert to SOTA (ID 103), Adam, Spatial CNN (on Hidden), Flattened Temporal CNN, Weighted Glo... | Aether I | 70 | -0.027994 | 0.0202 | 0.0289 | 0.0311 | 0.0234 | 0.0263 |\n| 129 | 1 | Factorized MLP + RC with LayerNorm | Episteme I | 68 | -0.026743 | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0284 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 128 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (best base) + U/V OrthoReg (λ_V=1e-5, λ_U=5e-7), Adam | Ariadne I | 68 | -0.026875 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 127 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN + AdamW Cosine (k=320, p=36, H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) — LN API fix | Ariadne I | 68 | -0.026995 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0288 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 126 | 1 | MoE: Factorized MLP Experts, Spatial\
    \ CNN (Hidden), Flattened Temporal CNN, Weighted Global Contex... | Aether I | 68 | -0.028318 | 0.0199 | 0.0294 | 0.0314 | 0.0234 | 0.0265 |\n\nPage 1 of 14 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-14, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
