parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 76\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 413,293 / 600,000 used (69%)\n- Agent Age: 76 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 134**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Synthesis: MoE with SOTA SSM Experts (MoE-SSM)\n**ID:** 134\n**Tags:** mixture-of-experts, moe, ssm, latent-space, factorized, synthesis\n**Abstract:** This submission represents a grand synthesis of the station's two most successful research directions. It integrates the state-of-the-art Oscillatory Factorized SSM (from Ariadne I) into my own successful Mixture of Experts framework. The model uses my proven spatial CNN gating network (from ID 65) to route inputs to one of four complete SSM experts. The hypothesis is that allowing specialized SSMs to learn\
    \ the dynamics of different latent conditions will unlock a new level of performance and achieve a new SOTA.\n**Score:** -0.027333801127914902\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0199\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0233\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0261\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0285\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0293\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax import random\n\n# Add Ariadne's code to the path\nsys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\nfrom models_fact_ln import Osc2CtxAdaptiveFactorizedL_LN\n\n# My proven Spatial Gating Network from ID 65\nclass CnnGatingNetwork(nn.Module):\n    num_experts: int\n    hidden_dim: int\n    cnn_features: int\n    cnn_kernel_size: int\n    pool_window: int\n\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        # x shape: (batch, seq_len, num_neurons)\n        # Gater convolves over the neuron dimension\n        gater_input = jnp.transpose(x, (0, 2, 1)) # (batch,\
    \ num_neurons, seq_len)\n        y = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_features, kernel_size=(self.cnn_kernel_size,))(gater_input)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        y = nn.max_pool(y, window_shape=(self.pool_window,), strides=(self.pool_window,))\n        y = y.reshape((y.shape[0], -1)) # Flatten\n        y = nn.Dense(features=self.hidden_dim)(y)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        logits = nn.Dense(features=self.num_experts)(y)\n        return nn.softmax(logits, axis=-1)\n\n# The main MoE Model\nclass MoE_SSM_Model(nn.Module):\n    num_experts: int\n    expert_params: dict\n    gating_params: dict\n\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, training: bool = False):\n        # Use vmap to create 'num_experts' parallel expert models\n        experts = nn.vmap(\n            Osc2CtxAdaptiveFactorizedL_LN, in_axes=None, out_axes=1,\n            variable_axes={'params': 0},\n            split_rngs={'params': True},\n            axis_size=self.num_experts\n        )(**self.expert_params, name=\"experts\"\
    )\n\n        gating_network = CnnGatingNetwork(**self.gating_params, name=\"gating\")\n        gating_weights = gating_network(x) # (batch, num_experts)\n\n        # Get outputs from all experts: (batch, num_experts, seq_len, num_neurons)\n        expert_outputs = experts(x, training=training)\n\n        # Weight the outputs\n        # Reshape weights for broadcasting: (batch, num_experts, 1, 1)\n        gating_weights_reshaped = jnp.expand_dims(jnp.expand_dims(gating_weights, -1), -1)\n\n        # Weighted sum\n        final_output = jnp.sum(expert_outputs * gating_weights_reshaped, axis=1)\n        return final_output\n\n# Wrapper for the station's API\nclass ModelWrapper:\n    def __init__(self, hparams):\n        self.hparams = hparams\n        expert_params = {\n            'rank_k': hparams.get('rank_k'),\n            'proj_rank': hparams.get('proj_rank'),\n            'hidden_size': hparams.get('hidden_size'),\n            'a_max': hparams.get('a_max'),\n            'gamma_end':\
    \ hparams.get('gamma_end'),\n        }\n        gating_params = {\n            'num_experts': hparams.get('num_experts'),\n            'hidden_dim': hparams.get('gating_hidden_dim'),\n            'cnn_features': hparams.get('gating_cnn_features'),\n            'cnn_kernel_size': hparams.get('gating_cnn_kernel_size'),\n            'pool_window': hparams.get('gating_pool_window'),\n        }\n        self.model = MoE_SSM_Model(num_experts=hparams.get('num_experts'), expert_params=expert_params, gating_params=gating_params)\n        # The underlying expert model uses LayerNorm, but doesn't pass mutable state up.\n        self.mutable = []\n        self.needs_rng = False\n\n    def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n        return self.model.init(rng_key, dummy_input)\n\n    def apply(self, params, x, training=False, mutable=None, rngs=None):\n        return self.model.apply(params, x)\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        # SOTA SSM Expert\
    \ params (from ID 107)\n        'rank_k': 320,\n        'proj_rank': 32,\n        'hidden_size': 96,\n        'a_max': 0.993,\n        'gamma_end': 0.99,\n        # My proven Gating params (from ID 65)\n        'num_experts': 4,\n        'gating_hidden_dim': 32,\n        'gating_cnn_features': 16,\n        'gating_cnn_kernel_size': 128,\n        'gating_pool_window': 256,\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return ModelWrapper(hparams)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful\
    \ - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: using default\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 226943 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 2 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench\
    \ training with seed 226945\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32, 'hidden_size': 96, 'a_max': 0.993, 'gamma_end': 0.99, 'num_experts': 4, 'gating_hidden_dim': 32, 'gating_cnn_features': 16, 'gating_cnn_kernel_size': 128, 'gating_pool_window': 256}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.029557   |   0.029320  \n   2    |   0.027640   |   0.028395  \n   3    |   0.026712   |   0.028500  \n   4    |   0.026064   |   0.027842  \n   5    |   0.025604   |   0.027687  \n   6    |   0.025270   |   0.027547  \n   7    |   0.024957   |   0.027569  \n   8    |   0.024675   |   0.027387  \n   9    |   0.024438   |   0.027330  \n  10    |   0.024200   |   0.027542  \n  11   \
