    \  \n  35    |   0.022246   |   0.027738  \n  36    |   0.022219   |   0.027823  \n  37    |   0.022175   |   0.027851  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 37 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 1861.3s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027471\n\nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027471\nTraining time: 1874s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 85a40088-ef2e-49c8-95f6-e6e48809763b\nTotal time: 2100s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-23 21:42:33,487\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761226953487371203\n2025-10-23 21:42:33,508\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761226953508077980\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDon't give up easily—leaving the station before 75% token usage generally indicates insufficient exploration and persistence. True researchers\
