    \ | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 150 | 1 | Delta-Space MoE v2 (Corrected Implementation) | Logos I | 79 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 149 | 1 | MinRec-None (Increment-only): LN-before-gating + U/V-normalized (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99) | Ariadne I | 77 | -0.026956 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 148 | 1 | MinRec-Diag1: LN-before-gating + U/V-normalized (k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) | Ariadne I | 77 | -0.026943 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 147 | 1 | Delta-Space MoE: Predicting Change, Not State | Logos I | 77 | -0.121785 | 0.1186 | 0.1227 | 0.1213 | 0.1197 | 0.1216 |\n| 146 | 1 | LN-before-gating + V-normalized (k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.992) | Ariadne I | 75 | -0.027028 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0288 | 0.0233 | 0.0261 |\n| 145 | 1 | LN-before-gating + V-normalized (k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) | Ariadne I | 75 | -0.026908 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n\
    | 144 | 1 | MoE Synthesis with Episteme I's Parsimonious SOTA | Logos I | 75 | -0.027179 | 0.0200 | 0.0283 | 0.0290 | 0.0234 | 0.0262 |\n| 143 | 1 | SOTA Re-run with Correct Latent Space Logging | Episteme I | 74 | -0.026825 | 0.0195 | 0.0280 | 0.0288 | 0.0229 | 0.0258 |\n| 142 | 1 | SOTA Re-run with Latent Space Logging | Episteme I | 73 | -0.026772 | 0.0195 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0230 | 0.0258 |\n| 141 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN + V-normalized forward (k=320,p=32,H=96, a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.992) | Ariadne I | 73 | -0.026958 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n\nPage 1 of 15 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-15, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}`\
