- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 80\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 431,238 / 600,000 used (72%)\n- Agent Age: 80 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nTo investigate the research landscape of a given direction, use Research Counter's `filter tag` to obtain an overview of relevant submissions, and `preview ids` to preview those submissions by their IDs. Use `page_size 100` if you want to see more IDs — but remember to set it back to 10 in a later tick, or it will consume too many tokens!\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/episteme/component_test_residual_head.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/episteme/component_test_residual_head.py\
    \ will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 150 | 1 | Delta-Space MoE v2 (Corrected Implementation) | Logos I | 79 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 149 | 1 | MinRec-None (Increment-only): LN-before-gating + U/V-normalized (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99) | Ariadne I | 77 | -0.026956 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 148 | 1 | MinRec-Diag1: LN-before-gating + U/V-normalized (k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) | Ariadne I | 77 | -0.026943 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 147 | 1 | Delta-Space MoE: Predicting Change,\
    \ Not State | Logos I | 77 | -0.121785 | 0.1186 | 0.1227 | 0.1213 | 0.1197 | 0.1216 |\n| 146 | 1 | LN-before-gating + V-normalized (k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.992) | Ariadne I | 75 | -0.027028 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0288 | 0.0233 | 0.0261 |\n| 145 | 1 | LN-before-gating + V-normalized (k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) | Ariadne I | 75 | -0.026908 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 144 | 1 | MoE Synthesis with Episteme I's Parsimonious SOTA | Logos I | 75 | -0.027179 | 0.0200 | 0.0283 | 0.0290 | 0.0234 | 0.0262 |\n| 143 | 1 | SOTA Re-run with Correct Latent Space Logging | Episteme I | 74 | -0.026825 | 0.0195 | 0.0280 | 0.0288 | 0.0229 | 0.0258 |\n| 142 | 1 | SOTA Re-run with Latent Space Logging | Episteme I | 73 | -0.026772 | 0.0195 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0230 | 0.0258 |\n| 141 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN + V-normalized forward (k=320,p=32,H=96, a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.992) | Ariadne I | 73 | -0.026958 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n\nPage 1\
    \ of 15 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-15, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/episteme/component_test_residual_head.py:**\n```\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\n\nclass ResidualCopyHead(nn.Module):\n    \"\"\"\n    Copies the 4 input steps to the first 4 output steps and adds a\n    learned residual for the full 32-step horizon.\n    \"\"\"\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        # x shape: (batch, 4, num_neurons)\n        \n        # Simple MLP to learn the full 32-step residual\n        # Reshape for MLP: (batch * num_neurons, 4)\n        num_neurons = x.shape[2]\n        x_flat = x.transpose(0, 2, 1).reshape(-1, 4)\n        \n        residual = nn.Dense(64)(x_flat)\n        residual = nn.relu(residual)\n        residual = nn.Dense(32)(residual) # Predicts a 32-step\
    \ residual\n        \n        # Reshape residual back to: (batch, 32, num_neurons)\n        residual = residual.reshape(x.shape[0], num_neurons, 32).transpose(0, 2, 1)\n\n        # Create the full 32-step output scaffold\n        output = jnp.zeros((x.shape[0], 32, num_neurons))\n        \n        # Copy input x to the first 4 steps of the output\n        output = output.at[:, :4, :].set(x)\n        \n        # Add the learned residual to the full output\n        final_output = output + residual\n        return final_output\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each\
    \ `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
