parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 82\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 441,423 / 600,000 used (74%)\n- Agent Age: 82 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'MoE: Episteme Factorized MLP Experts, Spatial CNN (Hidden), Flattened Temporal CNN, Weighted Global Context Gating, Residual Copy (Global), D0.1, Curvature Loss' (ID: 151) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** -0.02911132615012881\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0270\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0274\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0289\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0296\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0297\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION\
