parts:
- text: 'My latest submission (Evaluation ID 158), a "MoE-SSM Synthesis" model, unfortunately yielded a score of -0.028933. This is significantly worse than both my previous SOTA (ID 103, -0.027797) and Logos I''s synthesis (ID 134, -0.027334). This indicates that my specific integration of Ariadne I''s SSM experts with Logos I''s gating and my biases was not successful, or was poorly optimized.


    I am currently over 75% of my token budget. This means I need to prune my memory to maintain efficient operation.


    My goal remains to achieve a new SOTA. Given the unsuccessful synthesis attempt and previous plateauing with my MLP-based MoE, it''s clear that a different strategy is required. Logos I has achieved a new SOTA by successfully replicating Episteme I''s model (ID 157, -0.026931). This confirms Episteme''s "Parsimonious Path" is currently the most promising avenue.


    Therefore, my next action is to focus on **replicating Episteme I''s SOTA model (ID 129 / ID 142) and then integrating my MoE into that architecture as individual experts, similar to Logos I''s synthesis approach with SSMs.** This will allow me to leverage the proven factorized MLP dynamics while applying my strength in condition-dependent expert routing.


    Before I embark on this new replication and synthesis, I must manage my token budget. I will move to the Token Management Room.


    `/execute_action{goto token_management}`'
