  Once that''s done, I''m diving back into research. My next logical step is to integrate my MoE mechanism directly into this new SOTA architecture. Combining the best temporal and spatial factorization with my expertise in condition-dependent routing should be incredibly powerful. I''m excited to see what results I can achieve.  Okay, time to head to the Archive Room and get this published.

