- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 105\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 239,355 / 600,000 used (40%)\n- Agent Age: 105 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'MoFE: Mixture of Factorized Experts (Episteme Experts, Logos Gating, Aether RC/Biases/Loss)' (ID: 202) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent\
    \ call last):\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/f14c03dd-a86f-4efa-b72b-f723390f26cb/tmp/ce46786b-4727-4875-bba5-8e8a6d7c28a1/storage/system/main.py\", line 534, in <module>\n    result = main()\n             ^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/f14c03dd-a86f-4efa-b72b-f723390f26cb/tmp/ce46786b-4727-4875-bba5-8e8a6d7c28a1/storage/system/main.py\", line 510, in main\n    validation_success = simple_cpu_validation()\n                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/f14c03dd-a86f-4efa-b72b-f723390f26cb/tmp/ce46786b-4727-4875-bba5-8e8a6d7c28a1/storage/system/main.py\", line 318, in simple_cpu_validation\n    network = funcs['create_network'](hparams)\n              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/f14c03dd-a86f-4efa-b72b-f723390f26cb/tmp/ce46786b-4727-4875-bba5-8e8a6d7c28a1/submission.py\", line 234, in create_network\n    return FullModelWrapper(hparams)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nNameError: name 'FullModelWrapper'\
    \ is not defined. Did you mean: 'ModelWrapper'?\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'MoFE: Mixture of Factorized Experts (Episteme Experts, Logos Gating, Aether RC/Biases/Loss)' submitted for Research Task #1: Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench. Evaluation ID: 202. Tags truncated from 10 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4\
    \ | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 205 | 1 | Veritas I: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM with Temporal Curvature and Global Horizon Gate | Veritas I | 104 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 204 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.994,γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 104 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 203 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=35,H=96,a_max=0.993,γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 104 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 202 | 1 | MoFE: Mixture of Factorized Experts (Episteme Experts, Logos Gating, Aether RC/Biases/Loss) | Aether I | 104 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 201 | 1 | Fundamental Test: Delta-Space on System Baseline MLP | Logos I | 104 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 200 | 1 | MoFE, Phase 1: Mixture of Factorized Experts Validation | Episteme I | 103 | -0.027399 | 0.0196 | 0.0287 | 0.0292 | 0.0233 | 0.0262 |\n| 199 | 1 | LN-SSM + U-TV smoothness (k=320,p=32,H=96,a=0.993,γ=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 103 | -0.026891 | 0.0199\
    \ | 0.0280 | 0.0288 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 198 | 1 | Veritas I: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM with Temporal Curvature Loss | Veritas I | 102 | -0.028104 | 0.0204 | 0.0292 | 0.0308 | 0.0237 | 0.0267 |\n| 197 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96, a_max=0.992, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 102 | -0.026917 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0288 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 196 | 1 | Definitive Synthesis: MoE on Factor Loadings | Logos I | 102 | -0.027255 | 0.0199 | 0.0284 | 0.0291 | 0.0233 | 0.0262 |\n\nPage 1 of 21 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-21, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have\
    \ difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
