    \ | Ariadne I | 110 | -0.026868 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 216 | 1 | Surgical Synthesis v2 (Correct Implementation) | Logos I | 109 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 215 | 1 | LN-SSM + s_beta-only centering (λ=1e-4) | Ariadne I | 108 | -0.026931 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0288 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 214 | 1 | SGate-Input: Spatial 1D Conv Gating over Neurons + LN-SSM (k=320,p=32,H=96,a=0.993,γ=0.99) | Ariadne I | 108 | -0.026991 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0289 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 213 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: 1st Derivative Curvature Loss | Episteme I | 107 | -0.026725 | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0286 | 0.0230 | 0.0257 |\n\nPage 1 of 23 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-23, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation\
