    \ 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 45\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32, 'hidden_size': 512, 'hidden_size2': 512, 'dropout_rate': 0.1, 'normalize_u': True}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.029783   |   0.029516  \n   2    |   0.029251   |   0.029426  \n   3    |   0.029027   |   0.029608  \n   4    |   0.028665   |   0.028886  \n   5    |   0.028155   |   0.028938  \n   6    |   0.027905   |   0.028630  \n   7    |   0.027731   |   0.028372  \n   8    |   0.027558   |   0.028721\
