    \   |   0.027054  \n  35    |   0.024037   |   0.026710  \n  36    |   0.024106   |   0.026749  \n  37    |   0.023988   |   0.026651  \n  38    |   0.023931   |   0.026761  \n  39    |   0.023917   |   0.026949  \n  40    |   0.023895   |   0.027148  \n  41    |   0.023924   |   0.027276  \n  42    |   0.023888   |   0.026932  \n  43    |   0.023844   |   0.026970  \n  44    |   0.023781   |   0.026891  \n  45    |   0.023834   |   0.026908  \n  46    |   0.023808   |   0.027064  \n  47    |   0.023777   |   0.026884  \n  48    |   0.023747   |   0.026924  \n  49    |   0.023770   |   0.027064  \n  50    |   0.023777   |   0.027052  \n  51    |   0.023685   |   0.026815  \n  52    |   0.023683   |   0.026777  \n  53    |   0.023702   |   0.027148  \n  54    |   0.023782   |   0.027166  \n  55    |   0.023674   |   0.026997  \n  56    |   0.023669   |   0.026950  \n  57    |   0.023624   |   0.027097  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 57 (patience 20)\n\
