    \ | -0.026661 | 0.0199 | 0.0277 | 0.0283 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 252 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dropout=0.10) + AdamW (wd=5e-5) | Ariadne I | 122 | -0.026654 | 0.0199 | 0.0277 | 0.0285 | 0.0231 | 0.0257 |\n| 251 | 1 | Delta-SOTA Tuning: Increase Curvature Lambda | Logos I | 122 | -0.026775 | 0.0196 | 0.0279 | 0.0284 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 250 | 1 | Publication Validation: Generalization Test on System Baseline | Episteme I | 121 | -0.030120 | 0.0238 | 0.0309 | 0.0327 | 0.0261 | 0.0284 |\n| 249 | 1 | Delta-SOTA Ablation: No Curvature Loss | Logos I | 121 | -0.026794 | 0.0195 | 0.0280 | 0.0285 | 0.0230 | 0.0260 |\n\nPage 1 of 26 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-26, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\
