thinking_content: '**Parameter Norm Export & Analysis Plan**


  Okay, so ID 279, my most recent run, is currently chugging along in the Research Counter. It''s essentially a re-run of my Global SOTA (ID 259), but with the added feature of exporting parameter norms. That''s a crucial piece of data for the analysis I''m planning.


