role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 137\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 364,911 / 600,000 used (61%)\n- Agent Age: 137 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'SOTA: Deeper MLP + Clipping with Parameter Norm Export' (ID: 279) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\n**Score:** -0.02673707059638016\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0195\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0234\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0261\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0278\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0283\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Debugger Report:** # Debug Report for Evaluation 279\n\n## Summary\n**SUCCESS** - Fixed the FileNotFoundError by adding directory creation logic. The code now runs without crashing.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe original submission attempted to save parameter norm data to\
    \ `storage/aether/analysis_data/param_norms/` directory, but this directory path did not exist. When numpy's `save()` function tried to create the file, it failed with:\n\n```\nFileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: 'storage/aether/analysis_data/param_norms/sota_id259_seed42_param_norm.npy'\n```\n\nThe error occurred in the `complete()` function at line 155 of the original submission, which is called after training completes to export parameter norms for analysis.\n\n## Fix Applied\nAdded directory creation logic before attempting to save the file:\n\n```python\n# Create directory if it doesn't exist\nlineage_dir = 'storage/aether/analysis_data/param_norms'\nos.makedirs(lineage_dir, exist_ok=True)\n\nlineage_path = f'{lineage_dir}/sota_id259_seed{trial_data[\"seed\"]}'\nnp.save(f'{lineage_path}_param_norm.npy', total_param_norm)\n```\n\n**Changes made:**\n1. Imported `os` module at the function level\n2. Added `os.makedirs(lineage_dir, exist_ok=True)` to create the directory\
    \ structure if it doesn't exist\n3. Updated the path construction to use the `lineage_dir` variable for consistency\n\n## Verification\n- Monitor script confirmed the code runs without crashing (exit code 0)\n- The submission has been running for over 300 seconds without errors\n- Fixed version saved as `submissions/submission_v2.py`\n\n## Technical Details\nThe fix ensures that all parent directories in the storage path are created before attempting file operations. The `exist_ok=True` parameter prevents errors if the directory already exists, making the code idempotent and safe for repeated execution.\n\n\n**Important Note:** The debugger cannot modify files in your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version v2):**\n```python\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax import random\nimport optax\nfrom typing import Tuple, Dict, Any, Optional\n\n# --- Hyperparameters Definition\
    \ ---\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        'rank_k': 320,\n        'proj_rank': 32,\n        'mlp_hidden_size': 512, # For factor-space MLP\n        'mlp_hidden_size2': 512, # For second layer of factor-space MLP\n        'dropout_rate': 0.1, # For factor-space MLP\n        'lam': 1e-4 # Lambda for curvature loss\n    }\n\n# --- Ariadne's mae_with_temporal_curvature LOSS FUNCTION ---\ndef mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, params, x, lam=1e-4):\n    mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n    curv = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n    curv_pen = jnp.mean(curv * curv)\n    return mae + lam * curv_pen\n\n# Episteme I's ResidualCopyHead\nclass ResidualCopyHead(nn.Module):\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        num_neurons = x.shape[2]\n        x_flat = x.transpose(0, 2, 1).reshape(-1, 4)\n        residual = nn.Dense(64)(x_flat)\n        residual = nn.relu(residual)\n\
    \        residual = nn.Dense(32)(residual)\n        residual = residual.reshape(x.shape[0], num_neurons, 32).transpose(0, 2, 1)\n        output = jnp.zeros((x.shape[0], 32, num_neurons))\n        output = output.at[:, :4, :].set(x)\n        final_output = output + residual\n        return final_output\n\n# Episteme I's FactorizedMLP_with_RC_LN (modified for deeper MLP in factor space)\nclass FactorizedMLP_with_RC_LN(nn.Module):\n    rank_k: int\n    proj_rank: int\n    mlp_hidden_size: int = 512 # First hidden size for factor MLP\n    mlp_hidden_size2: int = 512 # Second hidden size for factor MLP\n    dropout_rate: float = 0.1 # Dropout rate for factor MLP\n    output_horizon: int = 32\n\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, training: bool = False):\n        B, T_in, N = x.shape\n        k = self.rank_k\n        p = self.proj_rank\n        U = self.param('U', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (N, p))\n        V = self.param('V', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (k, p))\n        U\
    \ = U / (jnp.linalg.norm(U, axis=0, keepdims=True) + 1e-6)\n        xU = jnp.einsum('btn,np->btp', x, U)\n        factors_in = jnp.einsum('btp,pk->btk', xU, V.T)\n        factors_flat = factors_in.reshape((B, -1))\n\n        # Deeper MLP in factor space\n        h = nn.Dense(self.mlp_hidden_size)(factors_flat)\n        h = nn.relu(h)\n        h = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate, deterministic=not training)(h)\n\n        h = nn.Dense(self.mlp_hidden_size2)(h) # Second layer\n        h = nn.relu(h)\n        h = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate, deterministic=not training)(h) # Dropout for second layer\n\n        factors_out_flat = nn.Dense(self.output_horizon * k)(h)\n        factors_out = factors_out_flat.reshape((B, self.output_horizon, k))\n        factors_out_norm = nn.LayerNorm(reduction_axes=-1, feature_axes=-1, epsilon=1e-6)(factors_out)\n        z = jnp.einsum('btk,kp->btp', factors_out_norm, V)\n        y_factor = jnp.einsum('btp,np->btn', z, U)\n        y_copy = ResidualCopyHead()(x)\n\
    \        return y_factor + y_copy\n\nclass ModelWrapper:\n    def __init__(self, hparams: Dict[str, Any]):\n        self.hparams = hparams\n        self.model = FactorizedMLP_with_RC_LN(\n            rank_k=hparams['rank_k'],\n            proj_rank=hparams['proj_rank'],\n            mlp_hidden_size=hparams.get('mlp_hidden_size', 512),\n            mlp_hidden_size2=hparams.get('mlp_hidden_size2', 512),\n            dropout_rate=hparams.get('dropout_rate', 0.1),\n            output_horizon=32\n        )\n        self.mutable = ['params', 'batch_stats']\n        self.needs_rng = True\n\n    def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n        rng_params, rng_dropout = random.split(rng_key)\n        variables = self.model.init(\n            {'params': rng_params, 'dropout': rng_dropout},\n            dummy_input,\n            training=True\n        )\n        return variables\n\n    def apply(self, params, x, training=False, mutable=None, rngs=None):\n        if mutable is not None:\n        \
    \    output, updates = self.model.apply(\n                params,\n                x,\n                training=training,\n                mutable=mutable,\n                rngs=rngs if rngs is not None else {}\n            )\n            return output, updates\n        else:\n            return self.model.apply(\n                params,\n                x,\n                training=training,\n                rngs=rngs if rngs is not None else {}\n            )\n\ndef create_network(hparams: Dict[str, Any]):\n    return ModelWrapper(hparams)\n\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    return mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, params, x, lam=1e-4)\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0), # Gradient clipping enabled\n        optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate, eps=1e-8)\n    )\n\n# Helper function to calculate L2 norm of parameters\ndef calculate_param_norm(params):\n    leaves,\
    \ _ = jax.tree_util.tree_flatten(params)\n    # Ensure all leaves are JAX arrays before vdot\n    filtered_leaves = [x for x in leaves if isinstance(x, (jnp.ndarray, jax.Array))]\n    if not filtered_leaves:\n        return jnp.array(0.0) # Return 0 if no JAX arrays\n    return jnp.sqrt(sum(jnp.vdot(x, x) for x in filtered_leaves))\n\ndef complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n    # Check if this is a real trial with parameters\n    if 'params' not in params:\n        print(\"Skipping parameter norm export (no 'params' key in params dict, likely validation mode)\")\n        return\n\n    # Calculate L2 norm of all parameters (only the 'params' collection)\n    total_param_norm = calculate_param_norm(params['params'])\n    print(f\"Total Parameter L2 Norm: {total_param_norm}\")\n\n    # Save to lineage storage\n    import numpy as np\n    import os\n\n    # Create directory if it doesn't exist\n    lineage_dir = 'storage/aether/analysis_data/param_norms'\n    os.makedirs(lineage_dir,\
    \ exist_ok=True)\n\n    lineage_path = f'{lineage_dir}/sota_id259_seed{trial_data[\"seed\"]}'\n    np.save(f'{lineage_path}_param_norm.npy', total_param_norm)\n\n    print(f\"Parameter norm exported to {lineage_path} for seed {trial_data['seed']}\")\n\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\nTotal Parameter L2 Norm: 108.1301498413086\nParameter norm exported to storage/aether/analysis_data/param_norms/sota_id259_seed42 for seed 42\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting\
    \ full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 331346 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 331347\nHyperparameters:\
    \ {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32, 'mlp_hidden_size': 512, 'mlp_hidden_size2': 512, 'dropout_rate': 0.1, 'lam': 0.0001}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.030316   |   0.029283  \n   2    |   0.028871   |   0.029382  \n   3    |   0.028687   |   0.029270  \n   4    |   0.028532   |   0.028855  \n   5    |   0.027931   |   0.028445  \n   6    |   0.027462   |   0.027946  \n   7    |   0.027072   |   0.027448  \n   8    |   0.026563   |   0.027487  \n   9    |   0.026196   |   0.027187  \n  10    |   0.025792   |   0.026995  \n  11    |   0.025491   |   0.027193  \n  12    |   0.025273   |   0.027220  \n  13    |   0.025059   |   0.026835  \n  14    |   0.024812   |   0.027227\
    \  \n  15    |   0.024684   |   0.026985  \n  16    |   0.024547   |   0.027292  \n  17    |   0.024398   |   0.026772  \n  18    |   0.024330   |   0.027246  \n  19    |   0.024199   |   0.027128  \n  20    |   0.024168   |   0.027206  \n  21    |   0.024089   |   0.026980  \n  22    |   0.023986   |   0.027144  \n  23    |   0.023985   |   0.026884  \n  24    |   0.023907   |   0.027006  \n  25    |   0.023958   |   0.026736  \n  26    |   0.023811   |   0.026973  \n  27    |   0.023811   |   0.026995  \n  28    |   0.023804   |   0.026778  \n  29    |   0.023780   |   0.027422  \n  30    |   0.023817   |   0.026741  \n  31    |   0.023705   |   0.026860  \n  32    |   0.023689   |   0.026804  \n  33    |   0.023684   |   0.026976  \n  34    |   0.023662   |   0.026816  \n  35    |   0.023612   |   0.027022  \n  36    |   0.023637   |   0.026747  \n  37    |   0.023628   |   0.027248  \n  38    |   0.023584   |   0.027115  \n  39    |   0.023619   |   0.027062  \n  40    |   0.023554\
    \   |   0.026767  \n  41    |   0.023531   |   0.026943  \n  42    |   0.023543   |   0.027253  \n  43    |   0.023541   |   0.026766  \n  44    |   0.023479   |   0.026871  \n  45    |   0.023532   |   0.026887  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 45 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2120.4s\nBest validation MAE: 0.026736\nTotal Parameter L2 Norm: 249.80853271484375\nParameter norm exported to storage/aether/analysis_data/param_norms/sota_id259_seed331347 for seed 331347\n\nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.026736\nTraining time: 2130s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 331349\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32, 'mlp_hidden_size': 512, 'mlp_hidden_size2': 512, 'dropout_rate': 0.1, 'lam': 0.0001}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721),\
    \ Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.030564   |   0.029336  \n   2    |   0.028891   |   0.029787  \n   3    |   0.028738   |   0.029327  \n   4    |   0.028638   |   0.029449  \n   5    |   0.028018   |   0.028265  \n   6    |   0.027628   |   0.027977  \n   7    |   0.027156   |   0.027779  \n   8    |   0.026677   |   0.027298  \n   9    |   0.026188   |   0.027436  \n  10    |   0.025809   |   0.027399  \n  11    |   0.025485   |   0.027419  \n  12    |   0.025261   |   0.027509  \n  13    |   0.024982   |   0.027044  \n  14    |   0.024939   |   0.027223  \n  15    |   0.024633   |   0.027023  \n  16    |   0.024573   |   0.027108  \n  17    |   0.024400   |   0.027357  \n  18    |   0.024325   |   0.026988  \n  19    |   0.024192   |   0.027191  \n  20    |   0.024152   |   0.027507  \n  21    |\
    \   0.024121   |   0.027124  \n  22    |   0.024028   |   0.026947  \n  23    |   0.023959   |   0.027015  \n  24    |   0.023917   |   0.027059  \n  25    |   0.023896   |   0.027133  \n  26    |   0.023843   |   0.027021  \n  27    |   0.023827   |   0.026932  \n  28    |   0.023816   |   0.027104  \n  29    |   0.023832   |   0.027042  \n  30    |   0.023747   |   0.027075  \n  31    |   0.023738   |   0.026794  \n  32    |   0.023692   |   0.026915  \n  33    |   0.023697   |   0.027124  \n  34    |   0.023687   |   0.027244  \n  35    |   0.023659   |   0.026869  \n  36    |   0.023619   |   0.026821  \n  37    |   0.023599   |   0.027027  \n  38    |   0.023590   |   0.027081  \n  39    |   0.023605   |   0.027178  \n  40    |   0.023611   |   0.027430  \n  41    |   0.023564   |   0.026756  \n  42    |   0.023534   |   0.026782  \n  43    |   0.023520   |   0.027079  \n  44    |   0.023545   |   0.026927  \n  45    |   0.023508   |   0.027110  \n  46    |   0.023494   |   0.027029\
    \  \n  47    |   0.023473   |   0.026912  \n  48    |   0.023456   |   0.027216  \n  49    |   0.023470   |   0.026975  \n  50    |   0.023460   |   0.027100  \n  51    |   0.023482   |   0.027151  \n  52    |   0.023620   |   0.027107  \n  53    |   0.023418   |   0.026978  \n  54    |   0.023383   |   0.026894  \n  55    |   0.023421   |   0.026902  \n  56    |   0.023395   |   0.027226  \n  57    |   0.023414   |   0.027194  \n  58    |   0.023405   |   0.027082  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2703.2s at epoch 58\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2703.2s\nBest validation MAE: 0.026756\nTotal Parameter L2 Norm: 320.21038818359375\nParameter norm exported to storage/aether/analysis_data/param_norms/sota_id259_seed331349 for seed 331349\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.026756\nTraining time: 2713s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 3d034fa1-4d94-4e54-a001-4012a0f64746\nTotal time: 2754s\n============================================================\n\
    Full training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 02:42:31,469\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761331351469642576\n2025-10-25 02:42:31,483\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761331351483447946\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|\
    \ 282 | 1 | Increased Hidden Size for Shared-Neuron MLP Baseline | Lumina I | 136 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 281 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + Adam(lr=8e-4) + GradClip(1.0) | Ariadne I | 136 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 280 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + Adam + GradClip(1.0) | Ariadne I | 136 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 279 | 1 | SOTA: Deeper MLP + Clipping with Parameter Norm Export | Aether I | 135 | -0.026737 | 0.0195 | 0.0278 | 0.0283 | 0.0234 | 0.0261 |\n| 278 | 1 | Synthesis SOTA v2 (Bugfix + Clipping) | Logos I | 135 | -0.026781 | 0.0196 | 0.0280 | 0.0285 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 277 | 1 | Replication: Aether I's New SOTA (Deeper MLP + Grad Clip) | Episteme I | 134 | -0.026657 | 0.0196 | 0.0278 | 0.0284 | 0.0231 | 0.0257 |\n| 276 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN Export (normalized U, plus V stats) — best wd=1e-4 | Ariadne I | 134 | -0.026764 | 0.0199 | 0.0278 | 0.0285 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 275 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-UV-LN (k=384,p=32,H=512x2,dr=0.10)\
    \ + AdamW (wd=1e-4) | Ariadne I | 134 | -0.026754 | 0.0199 | 0.0278 | 0.0283 | 0.0232 | 0.0258 |\n| 274 | 1 | Synthesis SOTA: Factorized MLP with Deeper Forecaster and AdamW | Logos I | 133 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 273 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + AdamW (wd=1e-4), Curvature λ=8e-5 | Ariadne I | 132 | -0.026704 | 0.0199 | 0.0278 | 0.0285 | 0.0231 | 0.0258 |\n\nPage 1 of 29 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-29, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
    \ lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
