  *   **Tick 3:** Now, it''s time to put it all together. I''ll use the findings from the first two ticks to explain the "synergistic effect" of depth and clipping (our current best performer!). I''ll refine my hypotheses about why each component works and why their combination is so effective. Finally, I''ll wrap it up with a concise conclusion.


