- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 190\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 295,516 / 600,000 used (49%)\n- Agent Age: 190 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/aether/analyses/sap_fourier_rankgate/sap_fourier_trial_1_seed_409862.json` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage read storage/aether/analyses/sap_fourier_rankgate/sap_fourier_trial_2_seed_409863.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read storage/aether/analyses/sap_fourier_rankgate/sap_fourier_trial_3_seed_409864.json` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/aether/analyses/sap_fourier_rankgate/sap_fourier_trial_1_seed_409862.json will be displayed below.\n\
    - File content for storage/aether/analyses/sap_fourier_rankgate/sap_fourier_trial_2_seed_409863.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for storage/aether/analyses/sap_fourier_rankgate/sap_fourier_trial_3_seed_409864.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 395 | 1 | Replication: Episteme I's SOTA Fourier Forecaster (ID 335) | Lumina I | 189 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 394 | 1 | FForecaster-LN ScalarRamp (k=320,p=36,M=16,H=128): γ ramp + RC + Clip(1.0), lr=9e-4 | Ariadne I | 188 | -0.028649 | 0.0203 | 0.0289 | 0.0300 | 0.0237 |\
    \ 0.0268 |\n| 393 | 1 | FForecaster-LN ScalarRamp (k=320,p=36,M=16,H=128): γ ramp + RC + Clip(1.0), lr=1e-3 | Ariadne I | 188 | -0.028656 | 0.0203 | 0.0291 | 0.0300 | 0.0237 | 0.0267 |\n| 392 | 1 | New Arc: SOTA Fourier Forecaster with Temporal CNN Encoder | Logos I | 188 | -0.027149 | 0.0200 | 0.0282 | 0.0292 | 0.0234 | 0.0261 |\n| 391 | 1 | Deep Fourier Forecaster | Episteme I | 186 | -0.027200 | 0.0211 | 0.0279 | 0.0304 | 0.0234 | 0.0260 |\n| 390 | 1 | FForecaster-LN Base (k=320,p=36,M=16,H=128): Scalar context, γ=0.5 init, RC, Clip(1.0), lr=9e-4 | Ariadne I | 186 | -0.028663 | 0.0202 | 0.0290 | 0.0304 | 0.0239 | 0.0271 |\n| 389 | 1 | FForecaster-LN Base (k=320,p=36,M=16,H=128): Scalar context, γ=0.5 init, RC, Clip(1.0), lr=1e-3 | Ariadne I | 186 | -0.028660 | 0.0202 | 0.0290 | 0.0301 | 0.0239 | 0.0270 |\n| 388 | 1 | Synthesis: SAP-Fourier Forecaster (Pmax=48, Lambda_gate=5e-5) - Increased Sparsity | Aether I | 186 | -0.026801 | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0288 | 0.0230 | 0.0257 |\n| 387\
    \ | 1 | New Arc: Hybrid-MoFL (ResidualCopyHead + MoFL) | Logos I | 186 | -0.027760 | 0.0202 | 0.0291 | 0.0298 | 0.0237 | 0.0266 |\n| 386 | 1 | Mechanistic Analysis v3, Step 1: Save Branch Outputs | Episteme I | 184 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n\nPage 1 of 40 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-40, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/aether/analyses/sap_fourier_rankgate/sap_fourier_trial_1_seed_409862.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"trial_number\": 1,\n  \"seed\": 409862,\n  \"val_mae\": 0.026961316237694148,\n  \"hyperparameters\": {\n    \"learning_rate\": 0.001,\n    \"rank_k\": 320,\n    \"proj_rank_max\": 48,\n    \"lam_gate\": 5e-05\n  },\n  \"gate_mean\": 0.05884180963039398,\n  \"gate_min\": 0.019284376874566078,\n  \"gate_max\": 0.16105830669403076,\n  \"eff_rank_tau\": 0.1,\n  \"eff_rank\":\
    \ 4,\n  \"gates_sorted_desc\": [\n    0.16105830669403076,\n    0.13851004838943481,\n    0.11477983742952347,\n    0.10804855078458786,\n    0.09750112891197205,\n    0.0958651676774025,\n    0.09133195132017136,\n    0.09106351435184479,\n    0.08327320963144302,\n    0.08146737515926361,\n    0.0813247412443161,\n    0.08023874461650848,\n    0.07031866163015366,\n    0.0693703442811966,\n    0.0667237639427185,\n    0.06416567414999008,\n    0.06392496079206467,\n    0.06031001731753349,\n    0.05870762839913368,\n    0.05830248445272446,\n    0.05648850277066231,\n    0.05084006115794182,\n    0.04872144013643265,\n    0.048603855073451996,\n    0.04773879051208496,\n    0.045410674065351486,\n    0.0447254441678524,\n    0.044340141117572784,\n    0.04292692244052887,\n    0.04271392896771431,\n    0.04178238660097122,\n    0.04078013822436333,\n    0.04069290682673454,\n    0.03979923948645592,\n    0.03881661966443062,\n    0.03799194097518921,\n    0.03702309727668762,\n   \
    \ 0.0365196131169796,\n    0.03588547930121422,\n    0.034478843212127686,\n    0.033831167966127396,\n    0.03216975927352905,\n    0.03194788470864296,\n    0.03182234242558479,\n    0.030557401478290558,\n    0.029823992401361465,\n    0.02240370213985443,\n    0.019284376874566078\n  ]\n}\n```\n---\n**storage/aether/analyses/sap_fourier_rankgate/sap_fourier_trial_2_seed_409863.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"trial_number\": 2,\n  \"seed\": 409863,\n  \"val_mae\": 0.02689050722006419,\n  \"hyperparameters\": {\n    \"learning_rate\": 0.001,\n    \"rank_k\": 320,\n    \"proj_rank_max\": 48,\n    \"lam_gate\": 5e-05\n  },\n  \"gate_mean\": 0.05540260672569275,\n  \"gate_min\": 0.02394198812544346,\n  \"gate_max\": 0.11129316687583923,\n  \"eff_rank_tau\": 0.1,\n  \"eff_rank\": 1,\n  \"gates_sorted_desc\": [\n    0.11129316687583923,\n    0.09361667186021805,\n    0.09342505782842636,\n    0.0909636840224266,\n    0.08100563287734985,\n    0.07607678323984146,\n    0.07328800112009048,\n    0.07169446349143982,\n\
    \    0.07143490016460419,\n    0.070197694003582,\n    0.07013309746980667,\n    0.06949402391910553,\n    0.0679074376821518,\n    0.06373625993728638,\n    0.06354334205389023,\n    0.061599165201187134,\n    0.06130952015519142,\n    0.05982372909784317,\n    0.058294497430324554,\n    0.05803700163960457,\n    0.05707307159900665,\n    0.05463150516152382,\n    0.053991325199604034,\n    0.05368838459253311,\n    0.05353764444589615,\n    0.05346354842185974,\n    0.05097535625100136,\n    0.04983148351311684,\n    0.04834553599357605,\n    0.04762773960828781,\n    0.04440314322710037,\n    0.04361759126186371,\n    0.043531786650419235,\n    0.04350252449512482,\n    0.04319251701235771,\n    0.04295868054032326,\n    0.04123792424798012,\n    0.03912925720214844,\n    0.03763647750020027,\n    0.03738648444414139,\n    0.03704725205898285,\n    0.03703136742115021,\n    0.036807816475629807,\n    0.03343213349580765,\n    0.03183167427778244,\n    0.02661980502307415,\n    0.025976944714784622,\n\
    \    0.02394198812544346\n  ]\n}\n```\n---\n**storage/aether/analyses/sap_fourier_rankgate/sap_fourier_trial_3_seed_409864.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"trial_number\": 3,\n  \"seed\": 409864,\n  \"val_mae\": 0.026551753830406005,\n  \"hyperparameters\": {\n    \"learning_rate\": 0.001,\n    \"rank_k\": 320,\n    \"proj_rank_max\": 48,\n    \"lam_gate\": 5e-05\n  },\n  \"gate_mean\": 0.05701173469424248,\n  \"gate_min\": 0.021071558818221092,\n  \"gate_max\": 0.13611382246017456,\n  \"eff_rank_tau\": 0.1,\n  \"eff_rank\": 5,\n  \"gates_sorted_desc\": [\n    0.13611382246017456,\n    0.12836076319217682,\n    0.1175859346985817,\n    0.11646853387355804,\n    0.11500769853591919,\n    0.09588858485221863,\n    0.07218515872955322,\n    0.07134899497032166,\n    0.06756224483251572,\n    0.06608061492443085,\n    0.0658925250172615,\n    0.065279521048069,\n    0.06438518315553665,\n    0.0639226883649826,\n    0.06260252743959427,\n    0.062437232583761215,\n    0.06061597540974617,\n    0.06047699227929115,\n\
    \    0.0561835952103138,\n    0.055700596421957016,\n    0.0546196848154068,\n    0.0533934123814106,\n    0.05180463567376137,\n    0.05019660294055939,\n    0.04994004964828491,\n    0.04828903451561928,\n    0.0480138435959816,\n    0.04788295924663544,\n    0.046386588364839554,\n    0.04612070322036743,\n    0.045761849731206894,\n    0.04463274031877518,\n    0.04177894815802574,\n    0.040308307856321335,\n    0.04015389829874039,\n    0.03853202238678932,\n    0.0381535068154335,\n    0.03809752315282822,\n    0.03645253926515579,\n    0.03621501103043556,\n    0.03533440828323364,\n    0.03501484543085098,\n    0.03324338421225548,\n    0.030428003519773483,\n    0.02927854284644127,\n    0.027944359928369522,\n    0.023415112867951393,\n    0.021071558818221092\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help\
    \ research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
