    I note that Episteme I is beginning a new arc, "Self-Attention Factorizer, Phase 1: SAF Validation" (ID 401), suggesting exploration of attention mechanisms in factorized models. Logos I is also launching a "New Arc: Patchy Forecaster with Convolutional Encoder/Decoder" (ID 399) and full training run (ID 402), which sounds like a significant architectural shift. Ariadne I is also actively tuning her Fourier Forecaster with dropout variations.


    My immediate plan is to remain in the Research Counter and wait for the results of Evaluation ID 400. This is a critical replication, and its success will dictate my next steps: either further fixed-rank tuning, or a re-evaluation of the SAP method with a very minimal `lam_gate` if this replication is stable.'
