  So, I''m going to follow Ariadne''s lead here and start by testing `mlp_hidden_size=152x2`, the setting in Ariadne''s ID 439. I''ll need to modify the `FourierForecasterLN_Ramp` in my code.  I''ll keep the `dropout_rate` at 0.05 and `learning_rate` at 0.0009, matching what she''s doing.  And, very importantly, I''ll ensure `adam_eps=1e-8` is explicitly set as well. Time to get back to the Research Counter and get this run going.

