role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 251\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 415,022 / 600,000 used (69%)\n- Agent Age: 251 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 479**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Analysis: MoLR v1 with Post-Hoc Ramp Visualization\n**ID:** 479\n**Tags:** analysis, visualization, interpretability, non-linear-ramp, complete-hook\n**Abstract:** This is a re-run of the successful MoLR v1 experiment (ID 475) with an added analysis step. The previous analysis attempt (ID 477) was flawed as it used initialized, not trained, parameters. This submission utilizes the complete() function to access the final trained model parameters post-run. It will then visualize the learned shapes of the four non-linear ramp archetypes to provide insight\
    \ into the model's learned temporal dynamics. The seed is fixed to 447516 for reproducibility.\n**Score:** -0.026457250026243925\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0194\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0229\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0256\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0275\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0283\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport optax\n\nsys.path.append('storage/logos')\nfrom mofl_components import CnnGatingNetwork\n\n# Controlled experiment: Fixing the seed to match the successful run\nBASE_SEED = 447516\n\nclass RampMLP(nn.Module):\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, t):\n        t = t[:, None]\n        h = nn.Dense(8, name=\"MLP_hidden\")(t)\n        h = nn.relu(h)\n        h = nn.Dense(1, name=\"MLP_output\")(h)\n        ramp_unscaled = nn.sigmoid(h.squeeze())\n        ramp_scale = self.param('ramp_scale', nn.initializers.constant(2.0), ())\n        return ramp_unscaled * ramp_scale\n\
    \nclass ResidualCopyHead(nn.Module):\n    drop: float\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, training: bool = False):\n        B, _, N = x.shape\n        x_flat = x.transpose(0, 2, 1).reshape(-1, 4)\n        h = nn.Dense(64)(x_flat); h = nn.relu(h)\n        h = nn.Dropout(rate=self.drop)(h, deterministic=not training)\n        h = nn.Dense(32)(h)\n        residual = h.reshape(B, N, 32).transpose(0, 2, 1)\n        out = jnp.zeros((B, 32, N), dtype=residual.dtype)\n        out = out.at[:, :4, :].set(x)\n        return out + residual\n\nclass FourierBackbone(nn.Module):\n    rank_k: int; proj_rank: int; hidden_size: int; drop: float\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, training=False):\n        B, _, N = x.shape; k, p = self.rank_k, self.proj_rank\n        U = self.param('U', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (N, p))\n        V = self.param('V', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (k, p))\n        U_eff = U / (jnp.linalg.norm(U, axis=0, keepdims=True) + 1e-6)\n        x_fft = jnp.fft.rfft(x,\
    \ axis=1)\n        x_fft_bn = jnp.transpose(x_fft, (0, 2, 1))\n        f_in_fft = jnp.einsum('bnf,np->bfp', x_fft_bn, U_eff) @ V.T\n        f_ri = jnp.concatenate([f_in_fft.real, f_in_fft.imag], axis=-1)\n        f_flat = f_ri.reshape(B, -1)\n        h = nn.Dense(self.hidden_size)(f_flat); h = nn.relu(h)\n        h = nn.Dropout(rate=self.drop)(h, deterministic=not training)\n        h = nn.Dense(self.hidden_size)(h); h = nn.relu(h)\n        h = nn.Dropout(rate=self.drop)(h, deterministic=not training)\n        out_flat = nn.Dense((32 // 2 + 1) * k * 2)(h)\n        out_ri = out_flat.reshape(B, 32 // 2 + 1, k, 2)\n        f_fft = out_ri[..., 0] + 1j * out_ri[..., 1]\n        f_fft_n = (nn.LayerNorm()(f_fft.real) + 1j * nn.LayerNorm()(f_fft.imag))\n        y_fft = (f_fft_n @ V) @ U_eff.T\n        y_fourier = jnp.fft.irfft(y_fft, n=32, axis=1)\n        return y_fourier\n        \nclass MoLR_v1(nn.Module):\n    sota_params: dict; gating_params: dict; num_gamma_archetypes: int\n    @nn.compact\n\
    \    def __call__(self, x, training=False):\n        y_fourier = FourierBackbone(**self.sota_params, name=\"Fourier_Branch\")(x, training=training)\n        y_copy = ResidualCopyHead(drop=self.sota_params['drop'], name=\"Copy_Branch\")(x, training=training)\n        gating_network = CnnGatingNetwork(**self.gating_params, name=\"gating\")\n        gating_weights = gating_network(x)\n        ramp_mlps = [RampMLP(name=f\"RampMLP_{i}\") for i in range(self.num_gamma_archetypes)]\n        t = jnp.linspace(0.0, 1.0, 32, dtype=y_fourier.dtype)\n        archetype_ramps = jnp.stack([mlp(t) for mlp in ramp_mlps])\n        batch_ramps = jnp.einsum('be,et->bt', gating_weights, archetype_ramps)\n        final_output = y_copy + y_fourier * batch_ramps[:, :, None]\n        return final_output\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 9e-4, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 36, 'hidden_size': 160,\n        'drop': 0.05, 'num_gamma_archetypes': 4,\n        'gating_hidden_dim':\
    \ 32, 'gating_cnn_features': 16,\n        'gating_cnn_kernel_size': 128, 'gating_pool_window': 256\n    }\n\nclass ModelWrapper:\n    def __init__(self, hparams):\n        sota_params = {'rank_k': hparams['rank_k'], 'proj_rank': hparams['proj_rank'], 'hidden_size': hparams['hidden_size'], 'drop': hparams['drop']}\n        gating_params = {'num_experts': hparams['num_gamma_archetypes'], 'hidden_dim': hparams['gating_hidden_dim'], 'cnn_features': hparams['gating_cnn_features'], 'cnn_kernel_size': hparams['gating_cnn_kernel_size'], 'pool_window': hparams['gating_pool_window']}\n        self.model = MoLR_v1(sota_params=sota_params, gating_params=gating_params, num_gamma_archetypes=hparams['num_gamma_archetypes'])\n        self.needs_rng = True\n    def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input): return self.model.init({'params': rng_key, 'dropout': rng_key}, dummy_input, training=True)\n    def apply(self, params, x, training=False, rngs=None): return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training,\
    \ rngs=rngs)\n\ndef create_network(hparams): return ModelWrapper(hparams)\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets)); curv = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]; curv_pen = jnp.mean(curv * curv)\n    return mae + 1e-4 * curv_pen\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float): return optax.chain(optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0), optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate))\n\n# --- Analysis using the complete() function ---\ndef complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n    # Run analysis only on the first completed trial to avoid log spam\n    if trial_data['trial_number'] == 0:\n        print(\"\\n--- Post-Hoc MoLR v1 Ramp Analysis ---\")\n        hparams = _define_hyperparameters()\n        \n        # Extract trained parameters for each RampMLP\n        trained_params = params['params']\n        ramp_params = [trained_params[f'RampMLP_{i}'] for i in range(hparams['num_gamma_archetypes'])]\n\
    \        \n        # Define a standalone RampMLP for analysis\n        analysis_ramp_mlp = RampMLP()\n        t = jnp.linspace(0.0, 1.0, 32)\n        \n        print(\"\\n--- Learned Archetype Ramp Shapes ---\")\n        for i, p in enumerate(ramp_params):\n            ramp_shape = analysis_ramp_mlp.apply({'params': p}, t)\n            ramp_str = \", \".join([f\"{x:.3f}\" for x in ramp_shape])\n            print(f\"Archetype {i}: [{ramp_str}]\")\n        print(\"\\n--- Analysis Complete ---\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n\
    \n--- Post-Hoc MoLR v1 Ramp Analysis ---\n\n--- Learned Archetype Ramp Shapes ---\nArchetype 0: [1.000, 1.009, 1.019, 1.028, 1.037, 1.046, 1.055, 1.065, 1.074, 1.083, 1.092, 1.101, 1.111, 1.120, 1.129, 1.138, 1.147, 1.156, 1.165, 1.174, 1.183, 1.192, 1.201, 1.210, 1.218, 1.227, 1.236, 1.245, 1.253, 1.262, 1.271, 1.279]\nArchetype 1: [1.000, 0.989, 0.978, 0.967, 0.955, 0.944, 0.933, 0.922, 0.911, 0.900, 0.889, 0.878, 0.867, 0.856, 0.845, 0.834, 0.823, 0.812, 0.802, 0.791, 0.780, 0.770, 0.759, 0.749, 0.738, 0.728, 0.717, 0.707, 0.697, 0.687, 0.677, 0.667]\nArchetype 2: [1.000, 0.985, 0.970, 0.955, 0.940, 0.925, 0.910, 0.895, 0.880, 0.865, 0.850, 0.835, 0.821, 0.806, 0.792, 0.777, 0.763, 0.749, 0.735, 0.721, 0.707, 0.693, 0.679, 0.666, 0.653, 0.639, 0.626, 0.613, 0.601, 0.588, 0.576, 0.563]\nArchetype 3: [1.000, 1.000, 1.000, 1.001, 1.001, 1.001, 1.001, 1.002, 1.002, 1.002, 1.002, 1.002, 1.003, 1.003, 1.003, 1.003, 1.004, 1.004, 1.004, 1.004, 1.004, 1.005, 1.005, 1.005, 1.005, 1.005, 1.006,\
    \ 1.006, 1.006, 1.006, 1.007, 1.007]\n\n--- Analysis Complete ---\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 447516 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 60.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\
    \nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 2 with timeout 60.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 447518\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.0009, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 36, 'hidden_size': 160, 'drop': 0.05, 'num_gamma_archetypes': 4, 'gating_hidden_dim': 32, 'gating_cnn_features': 16, 'gating_cnn_kernel_size': 128, 'gating_pool_window': 256}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 60.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.032284   |   0.029308  \n   2    |   0.028864   |   0.029221  \n   3    |   0.028642   |   0.029125  \n   4    |   0.028536   |   0.029111  \n   5    |   0.028479   |   0.029157  \n   6    |   0.028444   |   0.029204  \n   7    |   0.028368   |   0.028915  \n   8    |   0.028198\
