tick: 262
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 262\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 261,925 / 600,000 used (44%)\n- Agent Age: 262 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 494**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** FF-LN LearnableGamma + Tiny Input-Adaptive Residual (±5%) — per-condition export\n**ID:** 494\n**Tags:** fourier, layernorm, learnable-gamma, input-adaptive, horizon-gating, analysis\n**Abstract:** Ablation of tiny label-free residual horizon gating with smaller amplitude (±5%) atop Fourier LN + learnable γ. Exports per-condition step MAEs and residual gate stats to assess gains on hard conditions without labels.\n**Score:** -0.026300969373208225\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0197\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0229\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0255\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0273\n**Val_MAE_32:**\
    \ 0.0281\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys, os, json\nsys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\n\nimport numpy as np\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport optax\n\nfrom models_fourier_gamma_residual import create_network\nfrom losses import mae_with_temporal_curvature\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\nBATCH_SIZE = 8\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 9e-4,\n        'rank_k': 320,\n        'proj_rank': 36,\n        'hidden_size': 160,\n        'drop': 0.05,\n        'gamma_start': 0.25,\n        'gamma_end': 0.99,\n        'learn_gamma': True,\n        'residual_hidden': 32,\n        'residual_scale': 0.05  # smaller than ±7% test\n    }\n\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    return mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, params, x, lam=1e-4)\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n\
    \        optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate)\n    )\n\n# Utilities mirrored from earlier exports\ndef _find_key(tree, target):\n    if isinstance(tree, dict):\n        if target in tree:\n            return tree[target]\n        for v in tree.values():\n            res = _find_key(v, target)\n            if res is not None:\n                return res\n    return None\n\ndef _per_condition_step_mae(network, params, bs=4):\n    val_path = 'storage/system/data/val_data.npy'\n    lab_path = 'storage/system/data/val_condition_labels.npy'\n    Xv = np.load(val_path)             # (T,N)\n    Lv = np.load(lab_path).astype(int) # (T,)\n    T, N = Xv.shape\n    in_h, out_h = 4, 32\n    n_win = T - in_h - out_h + 1\n    if n_win <= 0:\n        return None\n    C = int(Lv.max() + 1)\n    sums = np.zeros((C, out_h), dtype=np.float64)\n    cnts = np.zeros((C, out_h), dtype=np.int64)\n    overall_sum = np.zeros((out_h,), dtype=np.float64)\n    overall_cnt = 0\n    for i0 in range(0, n_win, bs):\n\
    \        b = min(bs, n_win - i0)\n        xb = np.stack([Xv[i:i+in_h, :] for i in range(i0, i0 + b)], axis=0).astype(np.float32)\n        yb = np.stack([Xv[i+in_h:i+in_h+out_h, :] for i in range(i0, i0 + b)], axis=0).astype(np.float32)\n        preds = network.apply(params, xb, training=False)  # (b,32,N)\n        err = np.abs(np.array(preds) - yb).mean(axis=2)    # (b,32)\n        overall_sum += err.sum(axis=0); overall_cnt += b\n        for bi in range(b):\n            t0 = i0 + bi\n            step_labels = Lv[t0+in_h:t0+in_h+out_h]\n            for s in range(out_h):\n                c = int(step_labels[s])\n                sums[c, s] += float(err[bi, s]); cnts[c, s] += 1\n    with np.errstate(divide='ignore', invalid='ignore'):\n        means = np.where(cnts > 0, sums / np.maximum(cnts, 1), np.nan)\n    overall = overall_sum / max(overall_cnt, 1)\n    return {'step_mae_overall': overall.astype(np.float32).tolist(),\n            'step_mae_by_condition': means.astype(np.float32).tolist(),\n\
    \            'counts_by_condition': cnts.tolist()}\n\ndef _residual_gate_stats(params, bs=4):\n    \"\"\"Estimate residual gate magnitude and late-horizon emphasis over validation windows.\"\"\"\n    # Access residual params\n    res = _find_key(params, 'res')\n    if res is None:\n        return None\n    W1 = np.array(res['W1']); b1 = np.array(res['b1'])\n    W2 = np.array(res['W2']); b2 = np.array(res['b2'])\n    # Load val\n    Xv = np.load('storage/system/data/val_data.npy')  # (T,N)\n    T, N = Xv.shape; in_h, out_h = 4, 32\n    n_win = T - in_h - out_h + 1\n    if n_win <= 0:\n        return None\n    abs_sum = np.zeros((out_h,), dtype=np.float64)\n    mean_sum = np.zeros((out_h,), dtype=np.float64)\n    cnt = 0\n    # Quick pass\n    for i0 in range(0, n_win, bs):\n        b = min(bs, n_win - i0)\n        xb = np.stack([Xv[i:i+in_h, :] for i in range(i0, i0 + b)], axis=0).astype(np.float32)  # (b,4,N)\n        mu = xb.mean(axis=-1)    # (b,4)\n        sigma = xb.std(axis=-1)\
    \  # (b,4)\n        feats = np.concatenate([mu, sigma], axis=-1)  # (b,8)\n        h = np.matmul(feats, W1) + b1  # (b,H)\n        h = np.tanh(0.5 * h)  # cheap GELU-ish; exact GELU not critical for stats\n        out = np.matmul(h, W2) + b2     # (b,32)\n        g = np.tanh(out)                # in [-1,1]\n        abs_sum += np.abs(g).sum(axis=0)\n        mean_sum += g.sum(axis=0)\n        cnt += b\n    return {\n        'gate_abs_mean_by_step': (abs_sum / max(cnt, 1)).astype(np.float32).tolist(),\n        'gate_mean_by_step': (mean_sum / max(cnt, 1)).astype(np.float32).tolist(),\n        'windows': int(cnt)\n    }\n\ndef complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n    hparams = trial_data.get('hyperparameters', {})\n    network = create_network(hparams)\n    per_cond = _per_condition_step_mae(network, params, bs=4)\n    gate_stats = _residual_gate_stats(params, bs=8)\n    out = {\n        'trial_number': int(trial_data.get('trial_number', -1)),\n        'seed': int(trial_data.get('seed',\
    \ -1)),\n        'val_mae': float(trial_data.get('val_mae', -1.0)),\n        'hyperparameters': hparams,\n        'residual_gate_stats': gate_stats,\n        'per_condition': per_cond\n    }\n    out_dir = 'storage/ariadne/analyses/fourier_gamma_residual_poc'\n    os.makedirs(out_dir, exist_ok=True)\n    seed = trial_data.get('seed', 'unknown')\n    with open(os.path.join(out_dir, f'trial_{seed}.json'), 'w') as f:\n        json.dump(out, f, indent=2)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation\
    \ successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 60.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 60.0min\nStarting\
    \ ZAPBench training with seed 45\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.0009, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 36, 'hidden_size': 160, 'drop': 0.05, 'gamma_start': 0.25, 'gamma_end': 0.99, 'learn_gamma': True, 'residual_hidden': 32, 'residual_scale': 0.05}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 60.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.032606   |   0.029430  \n   2    |   0.029158   |   0.029324  \n   3    |   0.028967   |   0.029326  \n   4    |   0.028893   |   0.029206  \n   5    |   0.028837   |   0.029189  \n   6    |   0.028806   |   0.029171  \n   7    |   0.028785   |   0.029128  \n   8    |   0.028674   |   0.028843  \n   9    |   0.028472   |   0.028648  \n  10    |   0.028281   |   0.028532  \n  11    |   0.028077   |   0.028343  \n  12\
