    \  0.026375  \n  38    |   0.025330   |   0.026747  \n  39    |   0.025292   |   0.026471  \n  40    |   0.025244   |   0.026790  \n  41    |   0.025176   |   0.026720  \n  42    |   0.025166   |   0.026618  \n  43    |   0.025085   |   0.026721  \n  44    |   0.025054   |   0.026610  \n  45    |   0.024997   |   0.026670  \n  46    |   0.024967   |   0.026720  \n  47    |   0.024961   |   0.026505  \n  48    |   0.024862   |   0.026442  \n  49    |   0.024890   |   0.026852  \n  50    |   0.024843   |   0.027762  \n  51    |   0.024798   |   0.026428  \n  52    |   0.024813   |   0.026518  \n  53    |   0.024741   |   0.026572  \n  54    |   0.024711   |   0.026557  \n  55    |   0.024703   |   0.026571  \n  56    |   0.024678   |   0.026847  \n  57    |   0.024732   |   0.026941  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 57 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2520.6s\nBest validation MAE: 0.026375\n\nTrial 3 completed:\n\
