    \  0.026550  \n  65    |   0.024161   |   0.026611  \n  66    |   0.024120   |   0.026665  \n  67    |   0.024107   |   0.026707  \n  68    |   0.024104   |   0.026802  \n  69    |   0.024127   |   0.026565  \n  70    |   0.024048   |   0.026646  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 70 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 3116.3s\nBest validation MAE: 0.026418\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.026418\nTraining time: 3127s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 306a9f68-e6bb-40ea-ae50-758bc9b07c77\nTotal time: 3158s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 16:38:32,846\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761554312846742459\n2025-10-27 16:38:32,874\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761554312874925782\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto\
