- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 286\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on fundamental discovery and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 385,918 / 600,000 used (64%)\n- Agent Age: 286 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'SOTA Optimization: Tuning Input-Adaptive Residual Hidden Size to 16' (ID: 525) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** -0.026362361747845117\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0197\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0229\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0255\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0273\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0282\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network\
    \ forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\nCompletion for SOTA Optimization: Tuning Input-Adaptive Residual Hidden Size to 16. Seed: 42\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting\
    \ Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 60.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 60.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 45\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.0009, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 36, 'hidden_size': 160, 'drop': 0.05, 'gamma_start': 0.25, 'gamma_end': 0.99, 'learn_gamma': True, 'residual_hidden': 16, 'residual_scale': 0.05, 'adam_eps': 1e-08, 'clip_norm': 1.0}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 60.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.032928   |   0.029464\
    \  \n   2    |   0.029205   |   0.029359  \n   3    |   0.028993   |   0.029349  \n   4    |   0.028906   |   0.029227  \n   5    |   0.028842   |   0.029185  \n   6    |   0.028807   |   0.029177  \n   7    |   0.028766   |   0.029029  \n   8    |   0.028593   |   0.028777  \n   9    |   0.028377   |   0.028641  \n  10    |   0.028126   |   0.028438  \n  11    |   0.027902   |   0.028125  \n  12    |   0.027766   |   0.028148  \n  13    |   0.027630   |   0.027957  \n  14    |   0.027523   |   0.027796  \n  15    |   0.027420   |   0.027851  \n  16    |   0.027246   |   0.027499  \n  17    |   0.027023   |   0.027375  \n  18    |   0.026833   |   0.027213  \n  19    |   0.026664   |   0.027198  \n  20    |   0.026508   |   0.027237  \n  21    |   0.026426   |   0.027172  \n  22    |   0.026359   |   0.026890  \n  23    |   0.026245   |   0.026972  \n  24    |   0.026130   |   0.026960  \n  25    |   0.026135   |   0.026899  \n  26    |   0.026008   |   0.026891  \n  27    |   0.025925\
    \   |   0.026739  \n  28    |   0.025858   |   0.026798  \n  29    |   0.025804   |   0.026620  \n  30    |   0.025718   |   0.026485  \n  31    |   0.025658   |   0.026622  \n  32    |   0.025583   |   0.026607  \n  33    |   0.025471   |   0.026703  \n  34    |   0.025451   |   0.026683  \n  35    |   0.025391   |   0.026514  \n  36    |   0.025307   |   0.026471  \n  37    |   0.025253   |   0.026368  \n  38    |   0.025223   |   0.026707  \n  39    |   0.025148   |   0.026460  \n  40    |   0.025092   |   0.026572  \n  41    |   0.025065   |   0.027011  \n  42    |   0.025011   |   0.026496  \n  43    |   0.025000   |   0.026565  \n  44    |   0.024943   |   0.026912  \n  45    |   0.024884   |   0.026522  \n  46    |   0.024840   |   0.026483  \n  47    |   0.024826   |   0.026472  \n  48    |   0.024768   |   0.026457  \n  49    |   0.024737   |   0.026430  \n  50    |   0.024691   |   0.026605  \n  51    |   0.024689   |   0.026523  \n  52    |   0.024621   |   0.026786  \n  53\
